+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# Args\\n\\nNamed argument map used to pass parameters to contract entry points and deploy sessions.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { Args, NamedArg } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Classes\\n\\n### `Args`\\n\\nA map of named `CLValue` arguments. All contract calls and deploys use `Args` to pass parameters.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `args` | `Map<string, CLValue>` | Underlying argument map |\\n\\n#### Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew Args(args: Map<string, CLValue>)\\n```\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\n// Get an argument by name\\nargs.getByName(argName: string): CLValue | undefined\\n\\n// Insert or update an argument\\nargs.insert(key: string, value: CLValue): void\\n\\n// Serialize to bytes\\nargs.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n#### Static Methods\\n\\n```ts\\n// Create from a plain object\\nArgs.fromMap(args: Record<string, CLValue>): Args\\n\\n// Create from an array of NamedArg\\nArgs.fromNamedArgs(namedArgs: NamedArg[]): Args\\n\\n// Deserialize from bytes\\nArgs.fromBytes(bytes: Uint8Array): Args\\n```\\n\\n### `NamedArg`\\n\\nA single named argument - a `(name, CLValue)` pair.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `name` | `string` | Argument name |\\n| `value` | `CLValue` | Argument value |\\n\\n#### Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew NamedArg(name: string, value: CLValue)\\n```\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nnamedArg.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\nNamedArg.toBytesWithNamedArg(source: NamedArg): Uint8Array\\nNamedArg.fromBytes(bytes: Uint8Array): NamedArg\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { Args, newCLString, newCLU256 } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\n// Build args from a plain object\\nconst args = Args.fromMap({\\n  recipient: newCLString('account-hash-abc...'),\\n  amount: newCLU256('1000000000'),\\n});\\n\\n// Or insert incrementally\\nconst args2 = new Args(new Map());\\nargs2.insert('token_id', newCLU256('42'));\\n\\n// Retrieve a value\\nconst amount = args.getByName('amount');\\n```\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [CLValues Introduction](/clvalues/introduction) - Available CL value types\\n- [Args reference](/clvalues/Args) - Detailed Args documentation\\n- [`ContractCallBuilder`](/builders/ContractCallBuilder) - Uses `Args` for contract calls\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/args#args\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Named argument map used to pass parameters to contract entry points and deploy sessions.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/args.mdx#args\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nNamed argument map used to pass parameters to contract entry points and deploy sessions.\\n\",\"title\":\"Args\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/args#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/args.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"Args\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/args#classes\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/args.mdx#classes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Classes\",\"titles\":[\"Args\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/args#args-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>A map of named <code>CLValue</code> arguments. All contract calls and deploys use <code>Args</code> to pass parameters.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>args</code></td><td><code>Map&lt;string, CLValue&gt;</code></td><td>Underlying argument map</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/args.mdx#args-1\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nA map of named CLValue arguments. All contract calls and deploys use Args to pass parameters.\\nPropertyTypeDescriptionargsMap&lt;string, CLValue&gt;Underlying argument map\\n\",\"title\":\"Args\",\"titles\":[\"Args\",\"Classes\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/args#constructor\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> Args</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(args: Map</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">&lt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">string, CLValue</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">&gt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/args.mdx#constructor\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nnew Args(args: Map&lt;string, CLValue&gt;)\\n\",\"title\":\"Constructor\",\"titles\":[\"Args\",\"Classes\",\"Args\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/args#methods\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Get an argument by name</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">args.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getByName</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(argName: string): CLValue </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">|</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> undefined</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Insert or update an argument</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">args.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">insert</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(key: string, value: CLValue): </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">void</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Serialize to bytes</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">args.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(): Uint8Array</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/args.mdx#methods\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// Get an argument by name\\nargs.getByName(argName: string): CLValue | undefined\\n \\n// Insert or update an argument\\nargs.insert(key: string, value: CLValue): void\\n \\n// Serialize to bytes\\nargs.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"Args\",\"Classes\",\"Args\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/args#static-methods\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Create from a plain object</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">Args.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">fromMap</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(args: Record</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">&lt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">string, CLValue</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">&gt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">): Args</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=