+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# queryLatestBalanceDetails\\n\\nReturns the CSPR balance of an account including a breakdown of holds (locked amounts).\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.queryLatestBalanceDetails({\\n  mainPurseUnderPublicKey: publicKey.toHex(),\\n});\\n\\nconsole.log('Total:', result.totalBalance.toString());\\nconsole.log('Available:', result.availableBalance.toString());\\nconsole.log('Holds:', result.holds.length);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### identifier\\n\\n- **Type:** `PurseIdentifier`\\n\\nSame as [`queryLatestBalance`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance).\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<QueryBalanceDetailsResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface QueryBalanceDetailsResult {\\n  totalBalance: BigNumber;      // total CSPR including holds\\n  availableBalance: BigNumber;  // spendable balance\\n  holds: BalanceHold[];         // locked amounts\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### BalanceHold\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface BalanceHold {\\n  amount: BigNumber;  // locked amount in motes\\n  // additional hold metadata\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- `availableBalance = totalBalance - sum(holds)`\\n- Use `availableBalance` for withdrawal calculations\\n- Holds occur from staking, smart contract locks, etc.\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`queryLatestBalance`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/queryLatestBalanceDetails#querylatestbalancedetails\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the CSPR balance of an account including a breakdown of holds (locked amounts).</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/balance/queryLatestBalanceDetails.mdx#querylatestbalancedetails\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the CSPR balance of an account including a breakdown of holds (locked amounts).\\n\",\"title\":\"queryLatestBalanceDetails\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/queryLatestBalanceDetails#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki s