EraEndV1): EraEnd\\nEraEnd.fromV2(v2: EraEndV2): EraEnd\\n\",\"title\":\"Static Methods\",\"titles\":[\"EraEnd\",\"Classes\",\"EraEnd\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/era-end#erareport\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Era report (V1 only) containing equivocators, inactive validators, and rewards.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>equivocators</code></td><td><code>PublicKey[]</code></td><td>Double-signing validators</td></tr><tr><td><code>inactiveValidators</code></td><td><code>PublicKey[]</code></td><td>Inactive validators</td></tr><tr><td><code>rewards</code></td><td><code>EraReward[]</code></td><td>Per-validator rewards</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/era-end.mdx#erareport\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nEra report (V1 only) containing equivocators, inactive validators, and rewards.\\nPropertyTypeDescriptionequivocatorsPublicKey[]Double-signing validatorsinactiveValidatorsPublicKey[]Inactive validatorsrewardsEraReward[]Per-validator rewards\\n\",\"title\":\"EraReport\",\"titles\":[\"EraEnd\",\"Classes\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/era-end#erareward\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>A single validator reward entry.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>validator</code></td><td><code>PublicKey</code></td><td>Validator&#x27;s public key</td></tr><tr><td><code>amount</code></td><td><code>CLValueUInt512</code></td><td>Reward amount in motes</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/era-end.mdx#erareward\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nA single validator reward entry.\\nPropertyTypeDescriptionvalidatorPublicKeyValidator&#x27;s public keyamountCLValueUInt512Reward amount in motes\\n\",\"title\":\"EraReward\",\"titles\":[\"EraEnd\",\"Classes\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/era-end#constructor\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki