+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# makeCep18TransferDeploy\\n\\nCreates a `Deploy` for transferring CEP-18 (ERC-20 compatible) fungible tokens.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { makeCep18TransferDeploy } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst deploy = makeCep18TransferDeploy({\\n  contractPackageHash: 'hash-cep18-contract-abc...',\\n  from: senderPublicKey,\\n  recipient: recipientPublicKey,\\n  amount: '1000000000',   // token amount (check contract decimals)\\n  chainName: 'casper',\\n  payment: 3_000_000_000,\\n});\\n\\ndeploy.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putDeploy(deploy);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### contractPackageHash\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\nThe CEP-18 token contract's package hash.\\n\\n### from\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\n### recipient\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey | AccountHash` - required\\n\\n### amount\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\nToken amount. The decimal precision depends on the specific token contract.\\n\\n### chainName\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\n### payment\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - optional, default `3_000_000_000`\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Deploy`\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- CEP-18 is Casper's ERC-20 equivalent standard.\\n- The `amount` field is in the token's smallest unit. Check the contract's `decimals` setting.\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCep18TransferDeploy#makecep18transferdeploy\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a <code>Deploy</code> for transferring CEP-18 (ERC-20 compatible) fungible tokens.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCep18TransferDeploy.mdx#makecep18transferdeploy\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a Deploy for transferring CEP-18 (ERC-20 compatible) fungible tokens.\\n\",\"title\":\"makeCep18TransferDeploy\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCep18TransferDeploy#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-d