+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# ContractWasm\\n\\nA container for the raw WASM bytecode of a deployed contract.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { ContractWasm } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Class\\n\\n### `ContractWasm`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `bytes` | `string` | WASM bytecode as a string |\\n\\n#### Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew ContractWasm(bytes: string)\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// ContractWasm is typically obtained from StoredValue\\nconst result = await client.queryLatestGlobalState({\\n  key: 'hash-abc123...',\\n  path: [],\\n});\\n\\nif (result.storedValue.ContractWasm) {\\n  const wasm = result.storedValue.ContractWasm;\\n  console.log('WASM bytes length:', wasm.bytes.length);\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`Contract`](/types/contract) - Contract metadata including WASM hash\\n- [`ByteCode`](/types/byte-code) - System bytecode type\\n- [`StoredValue`](/types/stored-value) - Contains `ContractWasm`\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/contract-wasm#contractwasm\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>A container for the raw WASM bytecode of a deployed contract.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/contract-wasm.mdx#contractwasm\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nA container for the raw WASM bytecode of a deployed contract.\\n\",\"title\":\"ContractWasm\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/contract-wasm#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/contract-wasm.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"ContractWasm\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/contract-wasm#class\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/contract-wasm.mdx#class\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Class\",\"titles\":[\"ContractWasm\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/contract-wasm#contractwasm-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>bytes</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>WASM bytecode as a string</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/contract-wasm.mdx#contractwasm-1\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nPropertyTypeDescriptionbytesstringWASM bytecode as a string\\n\",\"title\":\"ContractWasm\",\"titles\":[\"ContractWasm\",\"Class\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/contract-wasm#constructor\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> ContractWasm</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(bytes: string)</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/contract-wasm.mdx#constructor\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nnew ContractWasm(bytes: string)\\n\",\"title\":\"Constructor\",\"titles\":[\"ContractWasm\",\"Class\",\"ContractWasm\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/contract-wasm#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// ContractWasm is typically obtained from StoredValue</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> client.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">queryLatestGlobalState</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  key: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;hash-abc123...&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  path: [],</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (result.storedValue.ContractWasm) {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> wasm</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> result.storedValue.ContractWasm;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;WASM bytes length:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, wasm.bytes.</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">length</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">}</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/contract-wasm.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// ContractWasm is typically obtained from StoredValue\\nconst result = await client.queryLatestGlobalState({\\n  key: &#x27;hash-abc123...&#x27;,\\n  path: [],\\n});\\n \\nif (result.storedValue.ContractWasm) {\\n  const wasm = result.storedValue.ContractWasm;\\n  console.log(&#x27;WASM bytes length:&#x27;, wasm.bytes.length);\\n}\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"ContractWasm\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/contract-wasm#see-also\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/types/contract\\\"><code>Contract</code></a> - Contract metadata including WASM hash</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/types/byte-code\\\"><code>ByteCode</code></a> - System bytecode type</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/types/stored-value\\\"><code>StoredValue</code></a> - Contains <code>ContractWasm</code></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/types/contract-wasm.mdx#see-also\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nContract - Contract metadata including WASM hash\\nByteCode - System bytecode type\\nStoredValue - Contains ContractWasm\\n\",\"title\":\"See Also\",\"titles\":[\"ContractWasm\"]}]}}"
