+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# makeCsprTransferTransaction\\n\\nCreates a `Transaction` (TransactionV1 format) for a native CSPR transfer.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { makeCsprTransferTransaction } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst transaction = makeCsprTransferTransaction({\\n  from: senderPublicKey,\\n  to: recipientPublicKey,\\n  amount: '2500000000',\\n  id: Date.now(),\\n  chainName: 'casper',\\n  payment: 100_000_000,\\n});\\n\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\n\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\nconsole.log('Hash:', result.transactionHash);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\nSame as [`makeCsprTransferDeploy`](/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy).\\n\\n| Parameter | Type | Required |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `from` | `PublicKey` | Yes |\\n| `to` | `PublicKey \\\\| AccountHash` | Yes |\\n| `amount` | `string` | Yes |\\n| `id` | `number` | Yes |\\n| `chainName` | `string` | Yes |\\n| `payment` | `number` | No |\\n| `ttl` | `string` | No |\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Transaction` (wrapping a `TransactionV1`).\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`makeCsprTransferDeploy`](/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy) - legacy format\\n- [`NativeTransferBuilder`](/builders/NativeTransferBuilder) - equivalent builder\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction#makecsprtransfertransaction\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a <code>Transaction</code> (TransactionV1 format) for a native CSPR transfer.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction.mdx#makecsprtransfertransaction\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a Transaction (TransactionV1 format) for a native CSPR transfer.\\n\",\"title\":\"makeCsprTransferTransaction\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> transaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> makeCsprTransferTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  from: senderPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  to: recipientPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  amount: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;2500000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  id: Date.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">now</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(),</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  chainName: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  payment: </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">100_000_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(transaction);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Hash:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, result.transactionHash);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst transaction = makeCsprTransferTransaction({\\n  from: senderPublicKey,\\n  to: recipientPublicKey,\\n  amount: &#x27;2500000000&#x27;,\\n  id: Date.now(),\\n  chainName: &#x27;casper&#x27;,\\n  payment: 100_000_000,\\n});\\n \\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\n \\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\nconsole.log(&#x27;Hash:&#x27;, result.transactionHash);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Same as <a href=\\\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy\\\"><code>makeCsprTransferDeploy</code></a>.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>from</code></td><td><code>PublicKey</code></td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><code>to</code></td><td><code>PublicKey | AccountHash</code></td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><code>amount</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><code>chainName</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><code>payment</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td><code>ttl</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>No</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nSame as makeCsprTransferDeploy.\\nParameterTypeRequiredfromPublicKeyYestoPublicKey | AccountHashYesamountstringYesidnumberYeschainNamestringYespaymentnumberNottlstringNo\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Transaction</code> (wrapping a <code>TransactionV1</code>).</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nTransaction (wrapping a TransactionV1).\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy\\\"><code>makeCsprTransferDeploy</code></a> - legacy format</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder\\\"><code>NativeTransferBuilder</code></a> - equivalent builder</li>\\