+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# CLValue.newCLString\\n\\nCreates a CLValue of type `String`.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { CLValue } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst value = CLValue.newCLString('hello world');\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### val\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nA UTF-8 string.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`CLValue` with `clType = CLType.String`.\\n\\n## Example\\n\\n```ts\\nconst args = Args.fromMap({\\n  name: CLValue.newCLString('MyToken'),\\n  symbol: CLValue.newCLString('MTK'),\\n});\\n```\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLString#clvaluenewclstring\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a CLValue of type <code>String</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLString.mdx#clvaluenewclstring\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a CLValue of type String.\\n\",\"title\":\"CLValue.newCLString\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLString#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLString.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLString\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLString#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> value</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> CLValue.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">newCLString</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shi