+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# CLValue.newCLByteArray\\n\\nCreates a CLValue of type `ByteArray` from a `Uint8Array`.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { CLValue } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst bytes = new Uint8Array(32); // 32-byte hash\\nconst value = CLValue.newCLByteArray(bytes);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### val\\n\\n- **Type:** `Uint8Array`\\n\\nRaw bytes. The length is encoded as part of the type: `CLType.ByteArray(n)`.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`CLValue` with `clType = CLType.ByteArray(val.length)`.\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Use for contract arguments that expect fixed-length byte arrays (e.g., 32-byte hashes).\\n- Use `CLValue.newCLAny(bytes)` for opaque raw bytes without a fixed length type.\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLByteArray#clvaluenewclbytearray\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a CLValue of type <code>ByteArray</code> from a <code>Uint8Array</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLByteArray.mdx#clvaluenewclbytearray\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a CLValue of type ByteArray from a Uint8Array.\\n\",\"title\":\"CLValue.newCLByteArray\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLByteArray#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLByteArray.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLByteArray\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLByteArray#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> bytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">32</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">); </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 32-byte hash</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> value</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> CLValue.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">newCLByteArray</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(bytes);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLByteArray.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst bytes = new Uint8Array(32); // 32-byte hash\\nconst value = CLValue.newCLByteArray(bytes);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLByteArray\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLByteArray#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLByteArray.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLByteArray\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLByteArray#val\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>Uint8Array</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Raw bytes. The length is encoded as part of the type: <code>CLType.ByteArray(n)</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLByteArray.mdx#val\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: Uint8Array\\n\\nRaw bytes. The length is encoded as part of the type: CLType.ByteArray(n).\\n\",\"title\":\"val\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLByteArray\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLByteArray#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>CLValue</code> with <code>clType = CLType.ByteArray(val.length)</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLByteArray.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nCLValue with clType = CLType.ByteArray(val.length).\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLByteArray\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLByteArray#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>Use for contract arguments that expect fixed-length byte arrays (e.g., 32-byte hashes).</li>\\n<li>Use <code>CLValue.newCLAny(bytes)</code> for opaque raw bytes without a fixed length type.</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLByteArray.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nUse for contract arguments that expect fixed-length byte arrays (e.g., 32-byte hashes).\\nUse CLValue.newCLAny(bytes) for opaque raw bytes without a fixed length type.\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLByteArray\"]}]}}"
