+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# Introduction to Clients & Transports\\n\\nThe Casper JS SDK uses a client-based architecture similar to viem. A **Client** groups related methods and is backed by a **Transport** that handles the actual network communication.\\n\\n## Client Types\\n\\n| Client | Purpose | Port |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `RpcClient` | Query chain state, submit transactions | 7777 |\\n| `SseClient` | Subscribe to real-time events | 9999 |\\n| `SpeculativeClient` | Dry-run transactions without submitting | 7778 |\\n\\n## Transport\\n\\nCurrently, `HttpHandler` is the only transport. It wraps axios for HTTP/HTTPS requests.\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst handler = new HttpHandler('http://<Node Address>:7777/rpc', {\\n  timeout: 30_000,         // optional, ms\\n  headers: { 'X-Api-Key': 'secret' },  // optional\\n});\\n```\\n\\n## Creating an RPC Client\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { HttpHandler, RpcClient } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst handler = new HttpHandler('http://<Node Address>:7777/rpc');\\nconst rpcClient = new RpcClient(handler);\\n\\nconst status = await rpcClient.getStatus();\\nconsole.log(status.chainspecName); // 'casper' or 'casper-test'\\n```\\n\\n## Creating an SSE Client\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { SseClient, EventName } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst sseClient = new SseClient('http://<Node Address>:9999/events');\\n\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.BlockAddedEventType, (raw) => {\\n  const event = raw.parseAsBlockAddedEvent();\\n  if (!event.err) console.log('New block!');\\n});\\n\\nsseClient.start();\\n```\\n\\n## CasperNetwork (High-Level Client)\\n\\nFor most applications, `CasperNetwork` wraps everything and auto-detects the node version:\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { CasperNetwork } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst rpcClient = new RpcClient(new HttpHandler('http://<Node Address>:7777/rpc'));\\nconst network = await CasperNetwork.create(rpcClient);\\n// auto-detects node version (1.x or 2.0) from getStatus()\\n```\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/clients/intro#introduction-to-clients--transports\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>The Casper JS SDK uses a client-based architecture similar to viem. A <strong>Client</strong> groups related methods and is backed by a <strong>Transport</strong> that handles the actual network communication.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/intro.mdx#introduction-to-clients--transports\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nThe Casper JS SDK uses a client-based architecture similar to viem. A Client groups related methods and is backed by a Transport that handles the actual network communication.\\n\",\"title\":\"Introduction to Clients &amp; Transports\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/clients/intro#client-types\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Client</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Port</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>RpcClient</code></td><td>Query chain state, submit transactions</td><td>7777</td></tr><tr><td><code>SseClient</code></td><td>Subscribe to real-time events</td><td>9999</td></tr><tr><td><code>SpeculativeClient</code></td><td>Dry-run transactions without submitting</td><td>7778</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/intro.mdx#client-types\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nClientPurposePortRpcClientQuery chain state, submit transactions7777SseClientSubscribe to real-time events9999SpeculativeClientDry-run transactions without submitting7778\\n\",\"title\":\"Client Types\",\"titles\":[\"Introduction to Clients &amp; Transports\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/intro#transport\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Currently, <code>HttpHandler</code> is the only transport. It wraps axios for HTTP/HTTPS requests.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> handler</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> HttpHandler</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;http://:7777/rpc&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  timeout: </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">30_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,         </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// optional, ms</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  headers: { </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;X-Api-Key&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;secret&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> },  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// optional</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/intro.mdx#transport\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nCurrently, HttpHandler is the only transport. It wraps axios for HTTP/HTTPS requests.\\n \\n \\nconst handler = new HttpHandler(&#x27;http://:7777/rpc&#x27;, {\\n  timeout: 30_000,         // optional, ms\\n  headers: { &#x27;X-Api-Key&#x27;: &#x27;secret&#x27; },  // optional\\n});\\n\",\"title\":\"Transport\",\"titles\":[\"Introduction to Clients &amp; Transports\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/intro#creating-an-rpc-client\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> handler</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> HttpHandler</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;http://:7777/rpc&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> rpcClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> RpcClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(handler);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> status</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getStatus</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(status.chainspecName); </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// &#x27;casper&#x27; or &#x27;casper-test&#x27;</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/intro.mdx#creating-an-rpc-client\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n \\nconst handler = new HttpHandler(&#x27;http://:7777/rpc&#x27;);\\nconst rpcClient = new RpcClient(handler);\\n \\nconst status = await rpcClient.getStatus();\\nconsole.log(status.chainspecName); // &#x27;casper&#x27; or &#x27;casper-test&#x27;\\n\",\"title\":\"Creating an RPC Client\",\"titles\":[\"Introduction to Clients &amp; Transports\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/intro#creating-an-sse-client\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> sseClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> SseClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;http://:9999/events&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">subscribe</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(EventName.BlockAddedEventType, (</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">raw</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">=&gt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> event</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> raw.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">parseAsBlockAddedEvent</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">!</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">event.err) console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;New block!&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">start</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/intro.mdx#creating-an-sse-client\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n \\nconst sseClient = new SseClient(&#x27;http://:9999/events&#x27;);\\n \\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.BlockAddedEventType, (raw) =&gt; {\\n  const event = raw.parseAsBlockAddedEvent();\\n  if (!event.err) console.log(&#x27;New block!&#x27;);\\n});\\n \\nsseClient.start();\\n\",\"title\":\"Creating an SSE Client\",\"titles\":[\"Introduction to Clients &amp; Transports\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/intro#caspernetwork-high-level-client\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>For most applications, <code>CasperNetwork</code> wraps everything and auto-detects the node version:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> rpcClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> RpcClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> HttpHandler</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;http://:7777/rpc&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">));</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> network</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> CasperNetwork.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">create</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(rpcClient);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// auto-detects node version (1.x or 2.0) from getStatus()</span></span></code></pre>\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/intro.mdx#caspernetwork-high-level-client\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nFor most applications, CasperNetwork wraps everything and auto-detects the node version:\\n \\n \\nconst rpcClient = new RpcClient(new HttpHandler(&#x27;http://:7777/rpc&#x27;));\\nconst network = await CasperNetwork.create(rpcClient);\\n// auto-detects node version (1.x or 2.0) from getStatus()\",\"title\":\"CasperNetwork (High-Level Client)\",\"titles\":[\"Introduction to Clients &amp; Transports\"]}]}}"
