+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# CLValue.newCLPublicKey\\n\\nCreates a CLValue of type `PublicKey`.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { CLValue, PublicKey } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst value = CLValue.newCLPublicKey(publicKey);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### val\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey`\\n\\nAn ED25519 or SECP256K1 public key.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`CLValue` with `clType = CLType.PublicKey`.\\n\\n## Example\\n\\n```ts\\nconst args = Args.fromMap({\\n  operator: CLValue.newCLPublicKey(operatorPublicKey),\\n  new_owner: CLValue.newCLPublicKey(newOwnerPublicKey),\\n});\\n```\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Some contracts expect `Key` (use `CLValue.newCLKey`), others expect `PublicKey` directly. Check the contract's entry point type.\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLPublicKey#clvaluenewclpublickey\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a CLValue of type <code>PublicKey</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLPublicKey.mdx#clvaluenewclpublickey\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a CLValue of type PublicKey.\\n\",\"title\":\"CLValue.newCLPublicKey\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLPublicKey#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLPublicKey.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLPublicKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLPublicKey#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> value</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> CLValue.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">newCLPublicKey</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(publicKey);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLPublicKey.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst value = CLValue.newCLPublicKey(publicKey);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLPublicKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLPublicKey#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLPublicKey.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLPublicKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLPublicKey#val\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>An ED25519 or SECP256K1 public key.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLPublicKey.mdx#val\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey\\n\\nAn ED25519 or SECP256K1 public key.\\n\",\"title\":\"val\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLPublicKey\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLPublicKey#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>CLValue</code> with <code>clType = CLType.PublicKey</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLPublicKey.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nCLValue with clType = CLType.PublicKey.\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLPublicKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLPublicKey#example\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> args</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> Args.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">fromMap</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  operator: CLValue.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">newCLPublicKey</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(operatorPublicKey),</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  new_owner: CLValue.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">newCLPublicKey</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(newOwnerPublicKey),</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLPublicKey.mdx#example\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst args = Args.fromMap({\\n  operator: CLValue.newCLPublicKey(operatorPublicKey),\\n  new_owner: CLValue.newCLPublicKey(newOwnerPublicKey),\\n});\\n\",\"title\":\"Example\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLPublicKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/clvalues/newCLPublicKey#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>Some contracts expect <code>Key</code> (use <code>CLValue.newCLKey</code>), others expect <code>PublicKey</code> directly. Check the contract&#x27;s entry point type.</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/clvalues/newCLPublicKey.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nSome contracts expect Key (use CLValue.newCLKey), others expect PublicKey directly. Check the contract&#x27;s entry point type.\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"CLValue.newCLPublicKey\"]}]}}"
