+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# SseClient\\n\\nThe `SseClient` connects to a Casper node's event stream (port 9999) and delivers real-time blockchain events.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { SseClient, EventName } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst sseClient = new SseClient('http://<Node Address>:9999/events');\\n\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.TransactionProcessedEventType, (raw) => {\\n  const event = raw.parseAsTransactionProcessedEvent();\\n  if (event.err) return;\\n  console.log('Processed:', event.val.transactionProcessed.hash);\\n});\\n\\nsseClient.start();\\n```\\n\\n## Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew SseClient(url: string)\\n```\\n\\n### Parameters\\n\\n#### url\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nThe SSE endpoint URL. Typically `http://<node>:9999/events`.\\n\\n## Methods\\n\\n### subscribe\\n\\n```ts\\nsseClient.subscribe(\\n  eventName: EventName,\\n  handler: (raw: RawEvent) => void\\n): Result<boolean, string>\\n```\\n\\nRegisters a handler for the given event type. Returns `Err` if already subscribed.\\n\\n### unsubscribe\\n\\n```ts\\nsseClient.unsubscribe(eventName: EventName): Result<boolean, string>\\n```\\n\\nRemoves the handler for the given event type.\\n\\n### start\\n\\n```ts\\nsseClient.start(eventId?: number): void\\n```\\n\\nOpens the EventSource connection and begins streaming. Call after all `subscribe()` calls.\\n\\nPass `eventId` to resume the stream from a specific event ID.\\n\\n### stop\\n\\n```ts\\nsseClient.stop(): void\\n```\\n\\nCloses the EventSource connection and stops streaming.\\n\\n## Available Events\\n\\n| Event | Description |\\n|---|---|\\n| [`BlockAdded`](/sse/block-added) | New block finalized |\\n| [`TransactionProcessed`](/sse/transaction-processed) | Transaction execution result |\\n| [`TransactionAccepted`](/sse/transaction-accepted) | Transaction accepted to mempool |\\n| [`TransactionExpired`](/sse/transaction-expired) | Transaction expired before processing |\\n| [`DeployProcessed`](/sse/deploy-processed) | Legacy deploy execution result |\\n| [`FinalitySignature`](/sse/finality-signature) | Validator finality signature |\\n| [`Fault`](/sse/fault) | Validator equivocation |\\n| [`Step`](/sse/step) | End-of-era auction step |\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#sseclient\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>The <code>SseClient</code> connects to a Casper node&#x27;s event stream (port 9999) and delivers real-time blockchain events.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#sseclient\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nThe SseClient connects to a Casper node&#x27;s event stream (port 9999) and delivers real-time blockchain events.\\n\",\"title\":\"SseClient\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"SseClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> sseClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> SseClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;http://:9999/events&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">subscribe</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(EventName.TransactionProcessedEventType, (</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">raw</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">=&gt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> event</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> raw.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">parseAsTransactionProcessedEvent</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (event.err) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">return</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Processed:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, event.val.transactionProcessed.hash);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">start</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst sseClient = new SseClient(&#x27;http://:9999/events&#x27;);\\n \\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.TransactionProcessedEventType, (raw) =&gt; {\\n  const event = raw.parseAsTransactionProcessedEvent();\\n  if (event.err) return;\\n  console.log(&#x27;Processed:&#x27;, event.val.transactionProcessed.hash);\\n});\\n \\nsseClient.start();\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"SseClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#constructor\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> SseClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(url: string)</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#constructor\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nnew SseClient(url: string)\\n\",\"title\":\"Constructor\",\"titles\":[\"SseClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"SseClient\",\"Constructor\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#url\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The SSE endpoint URL. Typically <code>http://&lt;node&gt;:9999/events</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#url\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string\\n\\nThe SSE endpoint URL. Typically http://&lt;node&gt;:9999/events.\\n\",\"title\":\"url\",\"titles\":[\"SseCl