dler for the given event type. Returns Err if already subscribed.\\n\",\"title\":\"subscribe\",\"titles\":[\"SseClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#unsubscribe\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">unsubscribe</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(eventName: EventName): Result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">&lt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">boolean, string</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">&gt;</span></span></code></pre>\\n<p>Removes the handler for the given event type.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#unsubscribe\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nsseClient.unsubscribe(eventName: EventName): Result&lt;boolean, string&gt;\\nRemoves the handler for the given event type.\\n\",\"title\":\"unsubscribe\",\"titles\":[\"SseClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#start\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">start</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(eventId</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">?:</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> number): </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">void</span></span></code></pre>\\n<p>Opens the EventSource connection and begins streaming. Call after all <code>subscribe()</code> calls.</p>\\n<p>Pass <code>eventId</code> to resume the stream from a specific event ID.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#start\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nsseClient.start(eventId?: number): void\\nOpens the EventSource connection and begins streaming. Call after all subscribe() calls.\\nPass eventId to resume the stream from a specific event ID.\\n\",\"title\":\"start\",\"titles\":[\"SseClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#stop\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">stop</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(): </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">void</span></span></code></pre>\\n<p>Closes the EventSource connection and stops streaming.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/sse-client.mdx#stop\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nsseClient.stop(): void\\nCloses the EventSource connection and stops streaming.\\n\",\"title\":\"stop\",\"titles\":[\"SseClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/sse-client#available-events\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/block-added\\\"><code>BlockAdded</code></a></td><td>New block finalized</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-processed\\\"><code>TransactionProcessed</code></a></td><td>Transaction execution result</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-accepted\\\"><code>TransactionAccepted</code></a></td><td>Transaction accepted to mempool</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-expired\\\"><code>TransactionExpired</code></a></td><td>Transaction expired before processing</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/deploy-processed\\\"><cod