+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# TransactionExpired\\n\\nFires when a transaction's time-to-live (TTL) expires before it was processed.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { SseClient, EventName } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.TransactionExpiredEventType, (raw) => {\\n  const result = raw.parseAsTransactionExpiredEvent();\\n  if (result.err) return;\\n\\n  const hash = result.val.transactionExpired.hash;\\n  console.log('Expired transaction:', hash);\\n  // → retry or notify the user\\n});\\n```\\n\\n## Payload\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface TransactionExpiredPayload {\\n  hash: TransactionHash; // hash of the expired transaction\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Default transaction TTL is 30 minutes. Set with `.ttl('60m')` on builders.\\n- A transaction can expire if the network is congested or the fee was too low.\\n- Retry by rebuilding and resubmitting with a fresh timestamp.\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`TransactionAccepted`](/sse/transaction-accepted)\\n- [`TransactionProcessed`](/sse/transaction-processed)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-expired#transactionexpired\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Fires when a transaction&#x27;s time-to-live (TTL) expires before it was processed.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-expired.mdx#transactionexpired\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nFires when a transaction&#x27;s time-to-live (TTL) expires before it was processed.\\n\",\"title\":\"TransactionExpired\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-expired#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-expired.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionExpired\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-expired#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">subscribe</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(EventName.TransactionExpiredEventType, (</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">raw</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">=&gt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> raw.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">parseAsTransactionExpiredEvent</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (result.err) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">return</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> hash</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> result.val.transactionExpired.hash;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Expired transaction:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, hash);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">  // → retry or notify the user</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-expired.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.TransactionExpiredEventType, (raw) =&gt; {\\n  const result = raw.parseAsTransactionExpiredEvent();\\n  if (result.err) return;\\n \\n  const hash = result.val.transactionExpired.hash;\\n  console.log(&#x27;Expired transaction:&#x27;, hash);\\n  // → retry or notify the user\\n});\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionExpired\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-expired#payload\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">interface</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> TransactionExpiredPayload</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">  hash</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> TransactionHash</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">; </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// hash of the expired transaction</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">}</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-expired.mdx#payload\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\ninterface TransactionExpiredPayload {\\n  hash: TransactionHash; // hash of the expired transaction\\n}\\n\",\"title\":\"Payload\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionExpired\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-expired#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>Default transaction TTL is 30 minutes. Set with <code>.ttl(&#x27;60m&#x27;)</code> on builders.</li>\\n<li>A transaction can expire if the network is congested or the fee was too low.</li>\\n<li>Retry by rebuilding and resubmitting with a fresh timestamp.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-expired.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nDefault transaction TTL is 30 minutes. Set with .ttl(&#x27;60m&#x27;) on builders.\\nA transaction can expire if the network is congested or the fee was too low.\\nRetry by rebuilding and resubmitting with a fresh timestamp.\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionExpired\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-expired#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-accepted\\\"><code>TransactionAccepted</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-processed\\\"><code>TransactionProcessed</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-expired.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nTransactionAccepted\\nTransactionProcessed\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionExpired\"]}]}}"
