+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# SSE Events\\n\\nThe Casper node exposes a Server-Sent Events (SSE) stream on port 9999 for real-time blockchain events.\\n\\n## Setup\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { SseClient, EventName } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst sseClient = new SseClient('http://<Node Address>:9999/events');\\n\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.BlockAddedEventType, (raw) => {\\n  const event = raw.parseAsBlockAddedEvent();\\n  if (!event.err) {\\n    console.log('New block:', event.val.blockAdded);\\n  }\\n});\\n\\nsseClient.start(); // opens the connection\\n```\\n\\n## Event Types\\n\\n| Event | When it fires |\\n|---|---|\\n| [`BlockAdded`](/sse/block-added) | A new block is finalized |\\n| [`TransactionProcessed`](/sse/transaction-processed) | A transaction completes execution |\\n| [`TransactionAccepted`](/sse/transaction-accepted) | A transaction is accepted to the mempool |\\n| [`TransactionExpired`](/sse/transaction-expired) | A transaction's TTL expires before execution |\\n| [`DeployProcessed`](/sse/deploy-processed) | A legacy deploy completes execution |\\n| [`FinalitySignature`](/sse/finality-signature) | A validator signs a block final |\\n| [`Fault`](/sse/fault) | A validator equivocates |\\n| [`Step`](/sse/step) | The end-of-era auction step runs |\\n\\n## Parsing Pattern\\n\\nEvery event arrives as a `RawEvent`. Parse it to get the typed event:\\n\\n```ts\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.TransactionProcessedEventType, (raw) => {\\n  // raw.data contains the JSON string\\n  const result = raw.parseAsTransactionProcessedEvent();\\n\\n  if (result.err) {\\n    console.error('Parse error:', result.val);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n\\n  const event = result.val; // TransactionProcessedEvent\\n  const payload = event.transactionProcessed;\\n});\\n```\\n\\nAll `parseAs*` methods return `Result<T, string>` from `ts-results`. Always check `.err` before accessing `.val`.\\n\\n## Rules\\n\\n- Only one handler per event type. Calling `subscribe` twice for the same event returns `Err`.\\n- Call `start()` after all `subscribe()` calls to avoid missing early events.\\n- EventSource reconnects automatically on connection loss.\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/sse/introduction#sse-events\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>The Casper node exposes a Server-Sent Events (SSE) stream on port 9999 for real-time blockchain events.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/introduction.mdx#sse-events\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nThe Casper node exposes a Server-Sent Events (SSE) stream on port 9999 for real-time blockchain events.\\n\",\"title\":\"SSE Events\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/sse/introduction#setup\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> sseClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> SseClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;http://:9999/events&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">subscribe</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(EventName.BlockAddedEventType, (</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">raw</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">=&gt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> event</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> raw.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">parseAsBlockAddedEvent</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">!</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">event.err) {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">    console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;New block:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, event.val.blockAdded);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  }</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">start</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(); </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// opens the connection</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/introduction.mdx#setup\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n \\nconst sseClient = new SseClient(&#x27;http://:9999/events&#x27;);\\n \\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.BlockAddedEventType, (raw) =&gt; {\\n  const event = raw.parseAsBlockAddedEvent();\\n  if (!event.err) {\\n    console.log(&#x27;New block:&#x27;, event.val.blockAdded);\\n  }\\n});\\n \\nsseClient.start(); // opens the connection\\n\",\"title\":\"Setup\",\"titles\":[\"SSE Events\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/introduction#event-types\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>When it fires</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/block-added\\\"><code>BlockAdded</code></a></td><td>A new block is finalized</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-processed\\\"><code>TransactionProcessed</code></a></td><td>A transaction completes execution</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-accepted\\\"><code>TransactionAccepted</code></a></td><td>A transaction is accepted to the mempool</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-expired\\\"><code>TransactionExpired</code></a></td><td>A transaction&#x27;s TTL expires before execution</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/deploy-processed\\\"><code>DeployProcessed</code></a></td><td>A legacy deploy completes execution</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/finality-signature\\\"><code>FinalitySignature</code></a></td><td>A validator signs a block final</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/fault\\\"><code>Fault</code></a></td><td>A validator equivocates</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/sse/step\\\"><code>Step</code></a></td><td>The end-of-era auction step runs</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/introduction.mdx#event-types\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nEventWhen it firesBlockAddedA new block is finalizedTransactionProcessedA transaction completes executionTransactionAcceptedA transaction is accepted to the mempoolTransactionExpiredA transaction&#x27;s TTL expires before executionDeployProcessedA legacy deploy completes executionFinalitySignatureA validator signs a block finalFaultA validator equivocatesStepThe end-of-era auction step runs\\n\",\"title\":\"Event Types\",\"titles\":[\"SSE Events\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/introduction#parsing-pattern\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Every event arrives as a <code>RawEvent</code>. Parse it to get the typed event:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">subscribe</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(EventName.TransactionProcessedEventType, (</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">raw</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">=&gt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">  // raw.data contains the JSON string</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> raw.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">parseAsTransactionProcessedEvent</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (result.err) {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">    console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">error</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Parse error:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, result.val);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">    return</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  }</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> event</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> result.val; </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// TransactionProcessedEvent</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> payload</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> event.transactionProcessed;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span></code></pre>\\n<p>All <code>parseAs*</code> methods return <code>Result</code> from <code>ts-results</code>. Always check <code>.err</code> before accessing <code>.val</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/introduction.mdx#parsing-pattern\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nEvery event arrives as a RawEvent. Parse it to get the typed event:\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.TransactionProcessedEventType, (raw) =&gt; {\\n  // raw.data contains the JSON string\\n  const result = raw.parseAsTransactionProcessedEvent();\\n \\n  if (result.err) {\\n    console.error(&#x27;Parse error:&#x27;, result.val);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n \\n  const event = result.val; // TransactionProcessedEvent\\n  const payload = event.transactionProcessed;\\n});\\nAll parseAs* methods return Result from ts-results. Always check .err before accessing .val.\\n\",\"title\":\"Parsing Pattern\",\"titles\":[\"SSE Events\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/introduction#rules\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>Only one handler per event type. Calling <code>subscribe</code> twice for the same event returns <code>Err</code>.</li>\\n<li>Call <code>start()</code> after all <code>subscribe()</code> calls to avoid missing early events.</li>\\n<li>EventSource reconnects automatically on connection loss.</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/introduction.mdx#rules\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nOnly one handler per event type. Calling subscribe twice for the same event returns Err.\\nCall start() after all subscribe() calls to avoid missing early events.\\nEventSource reconnects automatically on connection loss.\\n\",\"title\":\"Rules\",\"titles\":[\"SSE Events\"]}]}}"
