+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# TransactionScheduling\\n\\nControls when a transaction executes - immediately, at a future era, or at a future timestamp.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport {\\n  TransactionScheduling,\\n  FutureEraScheduling,\\n  FutureTimestampScheduling,\\n  TransactionSchedulingTag,\\n} from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Enum\\n\\n### `TransactionSchedulingTag`\\n\\n| Value | Description |\\n|---|---|\\n| `Native` (0) | Execute immediately in the current block |\\n| `FutureEra` (1) | Execute at or after a specific era |\\n| `FutureTimestamp` (2) | Execute at or after a specific timestamp |\\n\\n## Classes\\n\\n### `TransactionScheduling`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `standard?` | `object` | Standard (immediate) scheduling |\\n| `futureEra?` | `FutureEraScheduling` | Future era scheduling |\\n| `futureTimestamp?` | `FutureTimestampScheduling` | Future timestamp scheduling |\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nscheduling.tag(): TransactionSchedulingTag\\nscheduling.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\nscheduling.toJSON(): unknown\\nTransactionScheduling.fromJSON(json: any): TransactionScheduling\\nTransactionScheduling.fromBytes(bytes: Uint8Array): TransactionScheduling\\n```\\n\\n### `FutureEraScheduling`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `eraID` | `number` | Era ID at which to execute |\\n\\n#### Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew FutureEraScheduling(eraID: number)\\n```\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nscheduling.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n### `FutureTimestampScheduling`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `timestamp` | `Timestamp` | Timestamp at which to execute |\\n\\n#### Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew FutureTimestampScheduling(timestamp: Timestamp)\\n```\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nscheduling.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport {\\n  TransactionScheduling,\\n  FutureEraScheduling,\\n  FutureTimestampScheduling,\\n  Timestamp,\\n} from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\n// Standard (execute now)\\nconst immediate = new TransactionScheduling({});\\n\\n// Future era\\nconst futureEra = new TransactionScheduling(\\n  undefined,\\n  new FutureEraScheduling(100)\\n);\\n\\n// Future timestamp\\nconst futureTime = new TransactionScheduling(\\n  undefined,\\n  undefined,\\n  new FutureTimestampScheduling(\\n    new Timestamp(new Date(Date.now() + 60_000))  // 1 minute from now\\n  )\\n);\\n```\\n\\n:::note\\nMost transactions use standard (immediate) scheduling. Future era and timestamp scheduling are advanced features for time-locked operations.\\n:::\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`TransactionV1Payload`](/types/transaction-v1-payload) - Contains `scheduling`\\n- [`Time`](/types/time) - `Timestamp` type used by `FutureTimestampScheduling`\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-scheduling#transactionscheduling\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Controls when a transaction executes - immediately, at a future era, or at a future timestamp.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-scheduling.mdx#transactionscheduling\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nControls when a transaction executes - immediately, at a future era, or at a future timestamp.\\n\",\"title\":\"TransactionScheduling\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-scheduling#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  TransactionScheduling,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  FutureEraScheduling,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  FutureTimestampScheduling,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  TransactionSchedulingTag,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">} from </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper-js-sdk&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-scheduling.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n  TransactionScheduling,\\n  FutureEraScheduling,\\n  FutureTimestampScheduling,\\n  TransactionSchedulingTag,\\n} from &#x27;casper-js-sdk&#x27;;\\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionScheduling\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-scheduling#enum\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-scheduling.mdx#enum\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Enum\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionScheduling\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-scheduling#transactionschedulingtag\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Value</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>Native</code> (0)</td><td>Execute immediately in the current block</td></tr><tr><td><code>FutureEra</code> (1)</td><td>Execute at or after a specific era</td></tr><tr><td><code>FutureTimestamp</code> (2)</td><td>Execute at or after a specific timestamp</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-scheduling.mdx#transactionschedulingtag\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nValueDescriptionNative (0)Execute immediately in the current blockFutureEra (1)Execute at or after a specific eraFutureTimestamp (2)Execute at or after a specific timestamp\\n\",\"title\":\"TransactionSchedulingTag\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionScheduling\",\"Enum\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-scheduling#classes\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-scheduling.mdx#classes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Classes\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionScheduling\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-scheduling#transactionscheduling-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>