+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# makeCsprTransferDeploy\\n\\nCreates a legacy `Deploy` for a native CSPR transfer (Casper 1.x format).\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { makeCsprTransferDeploy } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { makeCsprTransferDeploy, PrivateKey, PublicKey, KeyAlgorithm } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst deploy = makeCsprTransferDeploy({\\n  from: senderPublicKey,\\n  to: recipientPublicKey,\\n  amount: '2500000000',    // 2.5 CSPR in motes\\n  id: Date.now(),\\n  chainName: 'casper',\\n  payment: 100_000_000,\\n});\\n\\ndeploy.sign(privateKey);\\n\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putDeploy(deploy);\\nconsole.log('Deploy hash:', result.deployHash);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### from\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\n### to\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey | AccountHash` - required\\n\\n### amount\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\nTransfer amount in motes.\\n\\n### id\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - required\\n\\nTransfer memo ID. Use `Date.now()` for a unique value.\\n\\n### chainName\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\n`'casper'` or `'casper-test'`.\\n\\n### payment\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - optional, default `100_000_000`\\n\\nGas payment in motes.\\n\\n### ttl\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - optional, default `'30m'`\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Deploy`\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`makeCsprTransferTransaction`](/utilities/makeCsprTransferTransaction) - TransactionV1 format\\n- [`NativeTransferBuilder`](/builders/NativeTransferBuilder) - builder pattern\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#makecsprtransferdeploy\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a legacy <code>Deploy</code> for a native CSPR transfer (Casper 1.x format).</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#makecsprtransferdeploy\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a legacy Deploy for a native CSPR transfer (Casper 1.x format).\\n\",\"title\":\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> deploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> makeCsprTransferDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  from: senderPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  to: recipientPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  amount: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;2500000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,    </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 2.5 CSPR in motes</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  id: Date.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">now</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(),</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  chainName: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  payment: </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">100_000_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">deploy.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(deploy);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Deploy hash:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, result.deployHash);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n \\nconst deploy = makeCsprTransferDeploy({\\n  from: senderPublicKey,\\n  to: recipientPublicKey,\\n  amount: &#x27;2500000000&#x27;,    // 2.5 CSPR in motes\\n  id: Date.now(),\\n  chainName: &#x27;casper&#x27;,\\n  payment: 100_000_000,\\n});\\n \\ndeploy.sign(privateKey);\\n \\nconst result = await rpcClient.putDeploy(deploy);\\nconsole.log(&#x27;Deploy hash:&#x27;, result.deployHash);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#from\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#from\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey - required\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"from\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#to\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey | AccountHash</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#to\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey | AccountHash - required\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"to\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#amount\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Transfer amount in motes.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#amount\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string - required\\n\\nTransfer amount in motes.\\n\",\"title\":\"amount\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#id\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>number</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Transfer memo ID. Use <code>Date.now()</code> for a unique value.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#id\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: number - required\\n\\nTransfer memo ID. Use Date.now() for a unique value.\\n\",\"title\":\"id\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#chainname\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><code>&#x27;casper&#x27;</code> or <code>&#x27;casper-test&#x27;</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#chainname\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string - required\\n\\n&#x27;casper&#x27; or &#x27;casper-test&#x27;.\\n\",\"title\":\"chainName\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#payment\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>number</code> - optional, default <code>100_000_000</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Gas payment in motes.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#payment\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: number - optional, default 100_000_000\\n\\nGas payment in motes.\\n\",\"title\":\"payment\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#ttl\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code> - optional, default <code>&#x27;30m&#x27;</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#ttl\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string - optional, default &#x27;30m&#x27;\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"ttl\",\"titles\":[\"makeCsprTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Deploy</code></p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nDeploy\\n\",\"t