+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# RpcClient\\n\\nThe `RpcClient` is the primary interface for querying the Casper Network. It implements the full Casper JSON-RPC 2.0 API.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst handler = new HttpHandler('http://<Node Address>:7777/rpc');\\nconst rpcClient = new RpcClient(handler);\\n\\nconst status = await rpcClient.getStatus();\\n```\\n\\n## Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew RpcClient(handler: IHandler)\\n```\\n\\n### Parameters\\n\\n#### handler\\n\\n- **Type:** `IHandler`\\n\\nThe transport to use for all requests. Typically an `HttpHandler` instance.\\n\\n## Methods\\n\\n### Block Actions\\n- [`getLatestBlock`](/actions/block/getLatestBlock) - Get the most recent block\\n- [`getBlockByHash`](/actions/block/getBlockByHash) - Get block by hash\\n- [`getBlockByHeight`](/actions/block/getBlockByHeight) - Get block by height\\n- [`getLatestBlockTransfers`](/actions/block/getLatestBlockTransfers) - Transfers in the latest block\\n\\n### Balance Actions\\n- [`queryLatestBalance`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance) - Query balance by various identifiers\\n- [`queryLatestBalanceDetails`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalanceDetails) - Balance with hold breakdown\\n\\n### Transaction Actions\\n- [`putTransaction`](/actions/transactions/putTransaction) - Submit a TransactionV1\\n- [`putDeploy`](/actions/transactions/putDeploy) - Submit a legacy Deploy\\n- [`waitForTransaction`](/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction) - Poll until confirmed\\n\\n### Account Actions\\n- [`getAccountInfo`](/actions/account/getAccountInfo) - Get account (1.x format)\\n- [`getLatestEntity`](/actions/account/getLatestEntity) - Get entity (2.x format)\\n\\n### State Actions\\n- [`queryLatestGlobalState`](/actions/state/queryLatestGlobalState) - Query contract storage\\n- [`getDictionaryItem`](/actions/state/getDictionaryItem) - Read a dictionary entry\\n\\n### Node Actions\\n- [`getStatus`](/actions/node/getStatus) - Node status and version\\n- [`getPeers`](/actions/node/getPeers) - Connected peers\\n\\n## Raw RPC Access\\n\\n```ts\\nconst response = await rpcClient.processCall({\\n  id: 1,\\n  jsonrpc: '2.0',\\n  method: 'chain_get_block',\\n  params: { block_identifier: { Height: 1000000 } },\\n});\\n```\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#rpcclient\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>The <code>RpcClient</code> is the primary interface for querying the Casper Network. It implements the full Casper JSON-RPC 2.0 API.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#rpcclient\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nThe RpcClient is the primary interface for querying the Casper Network. It implements the full Casper JSON-RPC 2.0 API.\\n\",\"title\":\"RpcClient\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> handler</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> HttpHandler</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;http://:7777/rpc&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> rpcClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> RpcClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(handler);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> status</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getStatus</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst handler = new HttpHandler(&#x27;http://:7777/rpc&#x27;);\\nconst rpcClient = new RpcClient(handler);\\n \\nconst status = await rpcClient.getStatus();\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#constructor\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> RpcClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(handler: IHandler)</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#constructor\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nnew RpcClient(handler: IHandler)\\n\",\"title\":\"Constructor\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\",\"Constructor\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#handler\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>IHandler</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The transport to use for all requests. Typically an <code>HttpHandler</code> instance.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#handler\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: IHandler\\n\\nThe transport to use for all requests. Typically an HttpHandler instance.\\n\",\"title\":\"handler\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\",\"Constructor\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#methods\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#methods\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#block-actions\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/block/getLatestBlock\\\"><code>getLatestBlock</code></a> - Get the most recent block</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/block/getBlockByHash\\\"><code>getBlockByHash</code></a> - Get block by hash</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/block/getBlockByHeight\\\"><code>getBlockByHeight</code></a> - Get block by height</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/block/getLatestBlockTransfers\\\"><code>getLatestBlockTransfers</code></a> - Transfers in the latest block</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#block-actions\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\ngetLatestBlock - Get the most recent block\\ngetBlockByHash - Get block by hash\\ngetBlockByHeight - Get block by height\\ngetLatestBlockTransfers - Transfers in the latest block\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Block Actions\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#balance-actions\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance\\\"><code>queryLatestBalance</code></a> - Query balance by various identifiers</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/balance/queryLatestBalanceDetails\\\"><code>queryLatestBalanceDetails</code></a> - Balance with hold breakdown</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#balance-actions\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nqueryLatestBalance - Query balance by various identifiers\\nqueryLatestBalanceDetails - Balance with hold breakdown\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Balance Actions\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#transaction-actions\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/transactions/putTransaction\\\"><code>putTransaction</code></a> - Submit a TransactionV1</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/transactions/putDeploy\\\"><code>putDeploy</code></a> - Submit a legacy Deploy</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction\\\"><code>waitForTransaction</code></a> - Poll until confirmed</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#transaction-actions\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nputTransaction - Submit a TransactionV1\\nputDeploy - Submit a legacy Deploy\\nwaitForTransaction - Poll until confirmed\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Transaction Actions\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#account-actions\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/account/getAccountInfo\\\"><code>getAccountInfo</code></a> - Get account (1.x format)</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/account/getLatestEntity\\\"><code>getLatestEntity</code></a> - Get entity (2.x format)</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#account-actions\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\ngetAccountInfo - Get account (1.x format)\\ngetLatestEntity - Get entity (2.x format)\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Account Actions\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#state-actions\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/state/queryLatestGlobalState\\\"><code>queryLatestGlobalState</code></a> - Query contract storage</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/state/getDictionaryItem\\\"><code>getDictionaryItem</code></a> - Read a dictionary entry</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#state-actions\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nqueryLatestGlobalState - Query contract storage\\ngetDictionaryItem - Read a dictionary entry\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"State Actions\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#node-actions\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/node/getStatus\\\"><code>getStatus</code></a> - Node status and version</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/node/getPeers\\\"><code>getPeers</code></a> - Connected peers</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#node-actions\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\ngetStatus - Node status and version\\ngetPeers - Connected peers\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Node Actions\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/rpc-client#raw-rpc-access\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> response</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">processCall</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  id: </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">1</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  jsonrpc: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;2.0&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  method: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;chain_get_block&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  params: { block_identifier: { Height: </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">1000000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> } },</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span></code></pre>\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/rpc-client.mdx#raw-rpc-access\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst response = await rpcClient.processCall({\\n  id: 1,\\n  jsonrpc: &#x27;2.0&#x27;,\\n  method: &#x27;chain_get_block&#x27;,\\n  params: { block_identifier: { Height: 1000000 } },\\n});\",\"title\":\"Raw RPC Access\",\"titles\":[\"RpcClient\"]}]}}"
