+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# Network Constants\\n\\nMainnet parameters sourced from the Casper 2.1 chainspec. These values are enforced at the protocol level.\\n\\n## Chain Identity\\n\\n| Parameter | Value |\\n|---|---|\\n| Network name | `casper` |\\n| Testnet name | `casper-test` |\\n| Protocol version | `2.1.2` |\\n\\n## Token & Motes\\n\\n| Parameter | Value |\\n|---|---|\\n| 1 CSPR | `1_000_000_000` motes |\\n| Minimum transfer | `2_500_000_000` motes (2.5 CSPR) |\\n| Minimum delegation | `500_000_000_000` motes (500 CSPR) |\\n| Maximum delegation | `1_000_000_000_000_000_000` motes |\\n\\n```ts\\n// Convert CSPR to motes\\nconst motes = BigInt(cspr) * 1_000_000_000n;\\n\\n// Minimum transfer (2.5 CSPR)\\nconst MIN_TRANSFER_MOTES = '2500000000';\\n\\n// Minimum delegation (500 CSPR)\\nconst MIN_DELEGATION_MOTES = '500000000000';\\n```\\n\\n## Transactions\\n\\n| Parameter | Value |\\n|---|---|\\n| Maximum TTL | 2 hours |\\n| Default TTL | 30 minutes (1,800,000 ms) |\\n| Max approvals per block | 2,600 |\\n| Max block size | ~2.5 MB |\\n| Block gas limit | 812,500,000,000 |\\n\\n:::note\\nTransaction TTL is measured in milliseconds in the SDK. The max allowed TTL is 2 hours (`7_200_000` ms). Transactions with a higher TTL will be rejected by the node.\\n:::\\n\\n## Gas & Fees\\n\\n| Parameter | Value |\\n|---|---|\\n| Gas per stored byte | 1,117,587 |\\n| Native transfer cost | 100,000,000 motes (0.1 CSPR) |\\n| Fee handling | Burned (not redistributed) |\\n| Unused gas refund | 75% returned to sender |\\n\\n## Consensus & Eras\\n\\n| Parameter | Value |\\n|---|---|\\n| Consensus protocol | Zug |\\n| Era duration | ~120 minutes |\\n| Minimum era height | 100 blocks |\\n| Minimum block time | 8,000 ms |\\n| Validator slots | 100 |\\n| Max delegators per validator | 1,200 |\\n\\n## Staking Delays\\n\\n| Parameter | Value | In Time |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| Auction delay | 1 era | ~2 hours |\\n| Unbonding delay | 7 eras | ~14 hours |\\n\\n:::warning\\nWhen you call `NativeUndelegateBuilder` and submit the transaction, staked funds are **not** immediately returned. They enter an unbonding queue and are released after ~7 eras (~14 hours).\\n:::\\n\\n## Ports\\n\\n| Service | Port | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| RPC | `7777` | JSON-RPC 2.0 API (`RpcClient`) |\\n| Speculative | `7778` | Dry-run execution (`SpeculativeClient`) |\\n| SSE | `9999` | Real-time event stream (`SseClient`) |\\n| REST | `8888` | Lightweight status/chainspec queries |\\n\\n## Public Nodes\\n\\nYou can use these public endpoints during development. For production, run your own node or use a dedicated RPC provider.\\n\\n| Network | URL |\\n|---|---|\\n| Mainnet | `http://65.21.235.219:7777/rpc` |\\n| Testnet | `http://136.243.187.84:7777/rpc` |\\n\\n:::warning\\nPublic nodes may be rate-limited, restarted, or removed at any time. Do not rely on them in production applications.\\n:::\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`NativeTransferBuilder`](/builders/NativeTransferBuilder) - transfer transactions\\n- [`NativeDelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder) - staking\\n- [`NativeUndelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder) - unstaking\\n- [Casper Protocol Docs](https://docs.casper.network) - full protocol specification\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#network-constants\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Mainnet parameters sourced from the Casper 2.1 chainspec. These values are enforced at the protocol level.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#network-constants\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nMainnet parameters sourced from the Casper 2.1 chainspec. These values are enforced at the protocol level.\\n\",\"title\":\"Network Constants\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#chain-identity\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Network name</td><td><code>casper</code></td></tr><tr><td>Testnet name</td><td><code>casper-test</code></td></tr><tr><td>Protocol version</td><td><code>2.1.2</code></td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#chain-identity\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nParameterValueNetwork namecasperTestnet namecasper-testProtocol version2.1.2\\n\",\"title\":\"Chain Identity\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#token--motes\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1 CSPR</td><td><code>1_000_000_000</code> motes</td></tr><tr><td>Minimum transfer</td><td><code>2_500_000_000</code> motes (2.5 CSPR)</td></tr><tr><td>Minimum delegation</td><td><code>500_000_000_000</code> motes (500 CSPR)</td></tr><tr><td>Maximum delegation</td><td><code>1_000_000_000_000_000_000</code> motes</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Convert CSPR to motes</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> motes</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> BigInt</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(cspr) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">*</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> 1_000_000_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">n</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Minimum transfer (2.5 CSPR)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> MIN_TRANSFER_MOTES</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\"> &#x27;2500000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Minimum delegation (500 CSPR)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> MIN_DELEGATION_MOTES</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\"> &#x27;500000000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#token--motes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nParameterValue1 CSPR1_000_000_000 motesMinimum transfer2_500_000_000 motes (2.5 CSPR)Minimum delegation500_000_000_000 motes (500 CSPR)Maximum delegation1_000_000_000_000_000_000 motes\\n// Convert CSPR to motes\\nconst motes = BigInt(cspr) * 1_000_000_000n;\\n \\n// Minimum transfer (2.5 CSPR)\\nconst MIN_TRANSFER_MOTES = &#x27;2500000000&#x27;;\\n \\n// Minimum delegation (500 CSPR)\\nconst MIN_DELEGATION_MOTES = &#x27;500000000000&#x27;;\\n\",\"title\":\"Token &amp; Motes\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#transactions\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Maximum TTL</td><td>2 hours</td></tr><tr><td>Default TTL</td><td>30 minutes (1,800,000 ms)</td></tr><tr><td>Max approvals per block</td><td>2,600</td></tr><tr><td>Max block size</td><td>~2.5 MB</td></tr><tr><td>Block gas limit</td><td>812,500,000,000</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<aside data-callout=\\\"note\\\"><p>Transaction TTL is measured in milliseconds in the SDK. The max allowed TTL is 2 hours (<code>7_200_000</code> ms). Transactions with a higher TTL will be rejected by the node.</p></aside>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#transactions\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nParameterValueMaximum TTL2 hoursDefault TTL30 minutes (1,800,000 ms)Max approvals per block2,600Max block size~2.5 MBBlock gas limit812,500,000,000\\nTransaction TTL is measured in milliseconds in the SDK. The max allowed TTL is 2 hours (7_200_000 ms). Transactions with a higher TTL will be rejected by the node.\\n\",\"title\":\"Transactions\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#gas--fees\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gas per stored byte</td><td>1,117,587</td></tr><tr><td>Native transfer cost</td><td>100,000,000 motes (0.1 CSPR)</td></tr><tr><td>Fee handling</td><td>Burned (not redistributed)</td></tr><tr><td>Unused gas refund</td><td>75% returned to sender</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#gas--fees\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nParameterValueGas per stored byte1,117,587Native transfer cost100,000,000 motes (0.1 CSPR)Fee handlingBurned (not redistributed)Unused gas refund75% returned to sender\\n\",\"title\":\"Gas &amp; Fees\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#consensus--eras\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Consensus protocol</td><td>Zug</td></tr><tr><td>Era duration</td><td>~120 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>Minimum era height</td><td>100 blocks</td></tr><tr><td>Minimum block time</td><td>8,000 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Validator slots</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><td>Max delegators per validator</td><td>1,200</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#consensus--eras\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nParameterValueConsensus protocolZugEra duration~120 minutesMinimum era height100 blocksMinimum block time8,000 msValidator slots100Max delegators per validator1,200\\n\",\"title\":\"Consensus &amp; Eras\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#staking-delays\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th><th>In Time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Auction delay</td><td>1 era</td><td>~2 hours</td></tr><tr><td>Unbonding delay</td><td>7 eras</td><td>~14 hours</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<aside data-callout=\\\"warning\\\"><p>When you call <code>NativeUndelegateBuilder</code> and submit the transaction, staked funds are <strong>not</strong> immediately returned. They enter an unbonding queue and are released after ~7 eras (~14 hours).</p></aside>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#staking-delays\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nParameterValueIn TimeAuction delay1 era~2 hoursUnbonding delay7 eras~14 hours\\nWhen you call NativeUndelegateBuilder and submit the transaction, staked funds are not immediately returned. They enter an unbonding queue and are released after ~7 eras (~14 hours).\\n\",\"title\":\"Staking Delays\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#ports\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Port</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>RPC</td><td><code>7777</code></td><td>JSON-RPC 2.0 API (<code>RpcClient</code>)</td></tr><tr><td>Speculative</td><td><code>7778</code></td><td>Dry-run execution (<code>SpeculativeClient</code>)</td></tr><tr><td>SSE</td><td><code>9999</code></td><td>Real-time event stream (<code>SseClient</code>)</td></tr><tr><td>REST</td><td><code>8888</code></td><td>Lightweight status/chainspec queries</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#ports\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nServicePortDescriptionRPC7777JSON-RPC 2.0 API (RpcClient)Speculative7778Dry-run execution (SpeculativeClient)SSE9999Real-time event stream (SseClient)REST8888Lightweight status/chainspec queries\\n\",\"title\":\"Ports\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#public-nodes\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>You can use these public endpoints during development. For production, run your own node or use a dedicated RPC provider.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Network</th><th>URL</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mainnet</td><td><code>http://65.21.235.219:7777/rpc</code></td></tr><tr><td>Testnet</td><td><code>http://136.243.187.84:7777/rpc</code></td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<aside data-callout=\\\"warning\\\"><p>Public nodes may be rate-limited, restarted, or removed at any time. Do not rely on them in production applications.</p></aside>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#public-nodes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nYou can use these public endpoints during development. For production, run your own node or use a dedicated RPC provider.\\nNetworkURLMainnethttp://65.21.235.219:7777/rpcTestnethttp://136.243.187.84:7777/rpc\\nPublic nodes may be rate-limited, restarted, or removed at any time. Do not rely on them in production applications.\\n\",\"title\":\"Public Nodes\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/network-constants#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder\\\"><code>NativeTransferBuilder</code></a> - transfer transactions</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeDelegateBuilder</code></a> - staking</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeUndelegateBuilder</code></a> - unstaking</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"https://docs.casper.network\\\">Casper Protocol Docs</a> - full protocol specification</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/network-constants.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nNativeTransferBuilder - transfer transactions\\nNativeDelegateBuilder - staking\\nNativeUndelegateBuilder - unstaking\\nCasper Protocol Docs - full protocol specification\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"Network Constants\"]}]}}"
