+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# Conversions\\n\\nUtility class for encoding/decoding between Base16, Base64, and hex, plus CSPR ↔ motes conversion.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { Conversions } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Class\\n\\n### `Conversions`\\n\\nAll methods are static.\\n\\n### Encoding\\n\\n```ts\\nConversions.encodeBase16(bytes: Uint8Array): string\\nConversions.decodeBase16(base16String: string): Uint8Array\\n\\nConversions.encodeBase64(bytes: Uint8Array): string\\nConversions.decodeBase64(base64String: string): Uint8Array\\n\\nConversions.base64to16(base64: string): string  // Base64 → Base16\\n```\\n\\n### CSPR ↔ Motes\\n\\n1 CSPR = 10⁹ motes (1,000,000,000).\\n\\n```ts\\nConversions.csprToMotes(cspr: string | number): BigNumber\\nConversions.motesToCSPR(motes: BigNumberish): string\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { Conversions } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\n// Hex encoding\\nconst hex = Conversions.encodeBase16(new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3]));\\n// '010203'\\n\\nconst bytes = Conversions.decodeBase16('010203');\\n// Uint8Array [1, 2, 3]\\n\\n// Base64\\nconst b64 = Conversions.encodeBase64(new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3]));\\nconst back = Conversions.decodeBase64(b64);\\n\\n// CSPR ↔ Motes\\nconst motes = Conversions.csprToMotes('2.5');\\n// BigNumber { value: '2500000000' }\\n\\nconst cspr = Conversions.motesToCSPR('2500000000');\\n// '2.5'\\n```\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`ByteConverters`](/types/byte-converters) - Low-level byte serialization\\n- [`HexBytes`](/types/hex-bytes) - Bytes wrapper with `.toHex()`\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/conversions#conversions\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Utility class for encoding/decoding between Base16, Base64, and hex, plus CSPR ↔ motes conversion.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/conversions.mdx#conversions\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nUtility class for encoding/decoding between Base16, Base64, and hex, plus CSPR ↔ motes conversion.\\n\",\"title\":\"Conversions\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/conve