+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# queryLatestBalance\\n\\nReturns the CSPR balance of an account or purse at the latest block.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.queryLatestBalance({\\n  mainPurseUnderPublicKey: publicKey.toHex(),\\n});\\n\\nconsole.log(result.balance.toString()); // in motes\\n// 1 CSPR = 1,000,000,000 motes\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### identifier\\n\\n- **Type:** `PurseIdentifier`\\n\\nSpecifies which balance to query. Exactly one field must be set:\\n\\n```ts\\ntype PurseIdentifier =\\n  | { mainPurseUnderPublicKey: string }     // public key hex\\n  | { mainPurseUnderAccountHash: string }   // 'account-hash-abc...'\\n  | { mainPurseUnderEntityAddr: string }    // 'entity-account-abc...'\\n  | { purseURef: string }                   // 'uref-abc...-007'\\n```\\n\\n#### By public key (most common)\\n\\n```ts\\nawait rpcClient.queryLatestBalance({\\n  mainPurseUnderPublicKey: '01a8b1...',\\n});\\n```\\n\\n#### By account hash\\n\\n```ts\\nawait rpcClient.queryLatestBalance({\\n  mainPurseUnderAccountHash: 'account-hash-abc123...',\\n});\\n```\\n\\n#### By URef\\n\\n```ts\\nawait rpcClient.queryLatestBalance({\\n  purseURef: 'uref-abc123...-007',\\n});\\n```\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<QueryBalanceResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface QueryBalanceResult {\\n  balance: BigNumber; // in motes\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`queryLatestBalanceDetails`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalanceDetails) - includes locked balance info\\n- [`queryBalanceByBlockHash`](/actions/balance/queryBalanceByBlockHash) - balance at a specific block\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance#querylatestbalance\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the CSPR balance of an account or purse at the latest block.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance.mdx#querylatestbalance\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the CSPR balance of an account or purse at the latest block.\\n\",\"title\":\"queryLatestBalance\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"queryLatestBalance\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">queryLatestBalance</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  mainPurseUnderPublicKey: publicKey.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toHex</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(),</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#2429