 class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  transaction: Transaction</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">): </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">Promise</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/CasperNetwork.mdx#puttransaction\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nSubmits a transaction to the node. Uses putTransaction for 2.0 nodes and putDeploy for 1.x nodes automatically.\\nnetwork.putTransaction(\\n  transaction: Transaction\\n): Promise\\n\",\"title\":\"putTransaction\",\"titles\":[\"CasperNetwork\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/CasperNetwork#gettransaction\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Fetches a transaction by hash, handling both <code>TransactionV1</code> and <code>Deploy</code> hash types.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">network.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  hash: TransactionHash </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">|</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> Hash </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">|</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> string</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">): </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">Promise</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/CasperNetwork.mdx#gettransaction\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nFetches a transaction by hash, handling both TransactionV1 and Deploy hash types.\\nnetwork.getTransaction(\\n  hash: TransactionHash | Hash | string\\n): Promise\\n\",\"title\":\"getTransaction\",\"titles\":[\"CasperNetwork\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/CasperNetwork#querylatestbalance\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Queries the latest balance for a purse identifier.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">network.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">queryLatestBalance</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  identifier: PurseIdentifier</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">): </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">Promise</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/CasperNetwork.mdx#querylatestbalance\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nQueries the latest balance for a purse identifier.\\nnetwork.queryLatestBalance(\\n  identifier: PurseIdentifier\\n): Promise\\n\",\"title\":\"queryLatestBalance\",\"titles\":[\"CasperNetwork\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/CasperNetwork#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>For 1.x nodes, <code>createDelegateTransaction</code>, <code>createUndelegateTransaction</code>, and <code>createRedelegateTransaction</code> require <code>auctionContractHash</code>.</li>\\n<li>All <code>create*</code> methods return a <code>Transaction</code> that still needs to be signed before calling <code>putTransaction</code>.</li>\\n<li>Access the underlying RPC client directly via <code>new RpcClient(...)</code> for all other RPC operations.</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/CasperNetwork.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nFor 1.x nodes, createDelegateTransaction, createUndelegateTransaction, and createRedelegateTransaction require auctionContractHash.\\nAll create* methods return a Transaction that still needs to be signed before calling putTransaction.\\nAccess the underlying RPC client directly via new RpcClient(...) for all other RPC operations.\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"CasperNetwork\"]}]}}"
