+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# NativeDelegateBuilder\\n\\nBuilds a native delegate (stake) transaction to stake CSPR with a validator.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { NativeDelegateBuilder, PublicKey } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst transaction = new NativeDelegateBuilder()\\n  .from(delegatorPublicKey)\\n  .validator(validatorPublicKey)\\n  .amount('500000000000')  // 500 CSPR\\n  .chainName('casper')\\n  .payment(2_500_000_000)\\n  .build();\\n\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n```\\n\\n## Methods\\n\\n### .from(publicKey)\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\nThe delegator's public key.\\n\\n### .validator(publicKey)\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\nThe validator to delegate to.\\n\\n### .amount(motes)\\n\\n- **Type:** `BigNumber | string` - required\\n\\nAmount to stake in motes.\\n\\n### .chainName(name)\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\n### .payment(motes)\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - optional\\n\\nGas payment in motes.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Transaction`\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Minimum delegation is `500_000_000_000` motes (500 CSPR) on mainnet.\\n- Delegated stake earns rewards each era (approximately every 2 hours).\\n- Use [`NativeUndelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder) to unstake.\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`NativeUndelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder)\\n- [`NativeRedelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder)\\n- [`makeAuctionManagerDeploy`](/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#nativedelegatebuilder\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Builds a native delegate (stake) transaction to stake CSPR with a validator.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#nativedelegatebuilder\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nBuilds a native delegate (stake) transaction to stake CSPR with a validator.\\n\",\"title\":\"NativeDelegateBuilder\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> transaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> NativeDelegateBuilder</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">from</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(delegatorPublicKey)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">validator</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(validatorPublicKey)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">amount</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;500000000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 500 CSPR</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">chainName</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">payment</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">2_500_000_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">build</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(transaction);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst transaction = new NativeDelegateBuilder()\\n  .from(delegatorPublicKey)\\n  .validator(validatorPublicKey)\\n  .amount(&#x27;500000000000&#x27;)  // 500 CSPR\\n  .chainName(&#x27;casper&#x27;)\\n  .payment(2_500_000_000)\\n  .build();\\n \\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#methods\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#methods\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#frompublickey\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The delegator&#x27;s public key.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#frompublickey\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey - required\\n\\nThe delegator&#x27;s public key.\\n\",\"title\":\".from(publicKey)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#validatorpublickey\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The validator to delegate to.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#validatorpublickey\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey - required\\n\\nThe validator to delegate to.\\n\",\"title\":\".validator(publicKey)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#amountmotes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>BigNumber | string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Amount to stake in motes.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#amountmotes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: BigNumber | string - required\\n\\nAmount to stake in motes.\\n\",\"title\":\".amount(motes)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#chainnamename\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#chainnamename\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string - required\\n\\n\",\"title\":\".chainName(name)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#paymentmotes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>number</code> - optional</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Gas payment in motes.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#paymentmotes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: number - optional\\n\\nGas payment in motes.\\n\",\"title\":\".payment(motes)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Transaction</code></p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nTransaction\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>Minimum delegation is <code>500_000_000_000</code> motes (500 CSPR) on mainnet.</li>\\n<li>Delegated stake earns rewards each era (approximately every 2 hours).</li>\\n<li>Use <a href=\\\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeUndelegateBuilder</code></a> to unstake.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nMinimum delegation is 500_000_000_000 motes (500 CSPR) on mainnet.\\nDelegated stake earns rewards each era (approximately every 2 hours).\\nUse NativeUndelegateBuilder to unstake.\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeUndelegateBuilder</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeRedelegateBuilder</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy\\\"><code>makeAuctionManagerDeploy</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nNativeUndelegateBuilder\\nNativeRedelegateBuilder\\nmakeAuctionManagerDeploy\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"NativeDelegateBuilder\"]}]}}"
