+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# makeNftTransferDeploy\\n\\nCreates a `Deploy` for transferring a CEP-78 NFT.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { makeNftTransferDeploy } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst deploy = makeNftTransferDeploy({\\n  contractPackageHash: 'hash-nft-contract-abc...',\\n  from: currentOwnerPublicKey,\\n  recipient: newOwnerPublicKey,\\n  tokenId: '42',\\n  chainName: 'casper',\\n  payment: 5_000_000_000,\\n});\\n\\ndeploy.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putDeploy(deploy);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### contractPackageHash\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\nThe CEP-78 NFT contract's package hash.\\n\\n### from\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\nCurrent NFT owner.\\n\\n### recipient\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey | AccountHash` - required\\n\\nNew NFT owner.\\n\\n### tokenId\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\nThe NFT's token ID.\\n\\n### chainName\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\n### payment\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - optional, default `5_000_000_000`\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Deploy`\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- CEP-78 is Casper's NFT standard.\\n- Token IDs are strings; they may be numeric strings (`'42'`) or metadata hashes depending on the contract.\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#makenfttransferdeploy\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a <code>Deploy</code> for transferring a CEP-78 NFT.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#makenfttransferdeploy\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a Deploy for transferring a CEP-78 NFT.\\n\",\"title\":\"makeNftTransferDeploy\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> deploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> makeNftTransferDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  contractPackageHash: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;hash-nft-contract-abc...&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  from: currentOwnerPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  recipient: newOwnerPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  tokenId: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;42&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  chainName: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  payment: </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">5_000_000_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">deploy.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(deploy);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst deploy = makeNftTransferDeploy({\\n  contractPackageHash: &#x27;hash-nft-contract-abc...&#x27;,\\n  from: currentOwnerPublicKey,\\n  recipient: newOwnerPublicKey,\\n  tokenId: &#x27;42&#x27;,\\n  chainName: &#x27;casper&#x27;,\\n  payment: 5_000_000_000,\\n});\\n \\ndeploy.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putDeploy(deploy);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#contractpackagehash\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The CEP-78 NFT contract&#x27;s package hash.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#contractpackagehash\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string - required\\n\\nThe CEP-78 NFT contract&#x27;s package hash.\\n\",\"title\":\"contractPackageHash\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#from\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Current NFT owner.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#from\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey - required\\n\\nCurrent NFT owner.\\n\",\"title\":\"from\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#recipient\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey | AccountHash</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>New NFT owner.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#recipient\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey | AccountHash - required\\n\\nNew NFT owner.\\n\",\"title\":\"recipient\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#tokenid\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The NFT&#x27;s token ID.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#tokenid\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string - required\\n\\nThe NFT&#x27;s token ID.\\n\",\"title\":\"tokenId\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#chainname\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#chainname\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string - required\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"chainName\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#payment\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>number</code> - optional, default <code>5_000_000_000</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#payment\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: number - optional, default 5_000_000_000\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"payment\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Deploy</code></p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nDeploy\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>CEP-78 is Casper&#x27;s NFT standard.</li>\\n<li>Token IDs are strings; they may be numeric strings (<code>&#x27;42&#x27;</code>) or metadata hashes depending on the contract.</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeNftTransferDeploy.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nCEP-78 is Casper&#x27;s NFT standard.\\nToken IDs are strings; they may be numeric strings (&#x27;42&#x27;) or metadata hashes depending on the contract.\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"makeNftTransferDeploy\"]}]}}"
