+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# NativeUndelegateBuilder\\n\\nBuilds a native undelegate transaction to unstake CSPR from a validator.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { NativeUndelegateBuilder, PublicKey } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst transaction = new NativeUndelegateBuilder()\\n  .from(delegatorPublicKey)\\n  .validator(validatorPublicKey)\\n  .amount('500000000000')  // 500 CSPR to unstake\\n  .chainName('casper')\\n  .payment(2_500_000_000)\\n  .build();\\n\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n```\\n\\n## Methods\\n\\n### .from(publicKey)\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\n### .validator(publicKey)\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\nThe validator to unstake from.\\n\\n### .amount(motes)\\n\\n- **Type:** `BigNumber | string` - required\\n\\nAmount to unstake in motes.\\n\\n### .chainName(name)\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- After undelegating, there is an **unbonding period** of 7 eras (~14 hours) before funds are returned.\\n- During the unbonding period, the stake does not earn rewards.\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`NativeDelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder)\\n- [`NativeRedelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#nativeundelegatebuilder\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Builds a native undelegate transaction to unstake CSPR from a validator.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#nativeundelegatebuilder\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nBuilds a native undelegate transaction to unstake CSPR from a validator.\\n\",\"title\":\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> transaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> NativeUndelegateBuilder</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">from</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(delegatorPublicKey)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">validator</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(validatorPublicKey)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">amount</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;500000000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 500 CSPR to unstake</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">chainName</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">payment</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">2_500_000_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">build</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(transaction);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst transaction = new NativeUndelegateBuilder()\\n  .from(delegatorPublicKey)\\n  .validator(validatorPublicKey)\\n  .amount(&#x27;500000000000&#x27;)  // 500 CSPR to unstake\\n  .chainName(&#x27;casper&#x27;)\\n  .payment(2_500_000_000)\\n  .build();\\n \\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#methods\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#methods\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#frompublickey\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#frompublickey\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey - required\\n\\n\",\"title\":\".from(publicKey)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#validatorpublickey\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The validator to unstake from.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#validatorpublickey\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey - required\\n\\nThe validator to unstake from.\\n\",\"title\":\".validator(publicKey)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#amountmotes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>BigNumber | string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Amount to unstake in motes.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#amountmotes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: BigNumber | string - required\\n\\nAmount to unstake in motes.\\n\",\"title\":\".amount(motes)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#chainnamename\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#chainnamename\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string - required\\n\\n\",\"title\":\".chainName(name)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>After undelegating, there is an <strong>unbonding period</strong> of 7 eras (~14 hours) before funds are returned.</li>\\n<li>During the unbonding period, the stake does not earn rewards.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nAfter undelegating, there is an unbonding period of 7 eras (~14 hours) before funds are returned.\\nDuring the unbonding period, the stake does not earn rewards.\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeDelegateBuilder</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeRedelegateBuilder</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nNativeDelegateBuilder\\nNativeRedelegateBuilder\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"NativeUndelegateBuilder\"]}]}}"
