",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Promise</code></p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">interface</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> PutTransactionResult</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">  transactionHash</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> string</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">}</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/putTransaction.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nPromise\\ninterface PutTransactionResult {\\n  transactionHash: string;\\n}\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"putTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/putTransaction#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>The transaction must be signed. Unsigned transactions will be rejected.</li>\\n<li>The returned hash can be used with <a href=\\\"/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction\\\"><code>waitForTransaction</code></a>.</li>\\n<li>Use <a href=\\\"/actions/transactions/putDeploy\\\"><code>putDeploy</code></a> only for raw <code>Deploy</code> objects (legacy API).</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/putTransaction.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nThe transaction must be signed. Unsigned transactions will be rejected.\\nThe returned hash can be used with waitForTransaction.\\nUse putDeploy only for raw Deploy objects (legacy API).\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"putTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/putTransac