+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# TransactionV1Payload\\n\\nThe payload of a Casper 2.x `TransactionV1`, containing all fields needed to build, sign, and submit a transaction.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { TransactionV1Payload, PayloadFields, ITransactionPayloadBuildParams } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Interface\\n\\n### `ITransactionPayloadBuildParams`\\n\\nBuilder parameters for constructing a payload.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `initiatorAddr` | `InitiatorAddr` | Who is sending the transaction |\\n| `args` | `Args` | Transaction arguments |\\n| `ttl` | `Duration` | Time-to-live |\\n| `entryPoint` | `TransactionEntryPoint` | Target entry point |\\n| `pricingMode` | `PricingMode` | Pricing strategy |\\n| `timestamp` | `Timestamp` | Creation timestamp |\\n| `transactionTarget` | `TransactionTarget` | Execution target |\\n| `scheduling` | `TransactionScheduling` | Scheduling strategy |\\n| `chainName` | `string` | Target chain |\\n\\n## Classes\\n\\n### `TransactionV1Payload`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `initiatorAddr` | `InitiatorAddr` | Transaction initiator |\\n| `timestamp` | `Timestamp` | Creation timestamp |\\n| `ttl` | `Duration` | Time-to-live |\\n| `pricingMode` | `PricingMode` | Pricing mode |\\n| `chainName` | `string` | Chain name |\\n| `fields` | `PayloadFields` | Encoded payload fields |\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\npayload.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\nTransactionV1Payload.build(params: ITransactionPayloadBuildParams): TransactionV1Payload\\n```\\n\\n### `PayloadFields`\\n\\nInternal representation of the serialized payload fields map.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `args` | `Args` | Transaction arguments |\\n| `target` | `TransactionTarget` | Execution target |\\n| `entryPoint` | `TransactionEntryPoint` | Entry point |\\n| `scheduling` | `TransactionScheduling` | Scheduling |\\n| `fields` | `Map<number, Uint8Array>` | Raw serialized fields |\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nfields.addField(field: number, value: Uint8Array): void\\nfields.getFieldValue(fieldIndex: number): Uint8Array | undefined\\nfields.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n\\nPayloadFields.build(\\n  args: Args,\\n  transactionTarget: TransactionTarget,\\n  transactionEntryPoint: TransactionEntryPoint,\\n  transactionScheduling: TransactionScheduling\\n): PayloadFields\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport {\\n  TransactionV1Payload, TransactionV1,\\n  InitiatorAddr, Args, Duration, Timestamp,\\n  TransactionEntryPoint, TransactionEntryPointEnum,\\n  PricingMode, PaymentLimitedMode,\\n  TransactionTarget, TransactionScheduling,\\n  newCLU512, PrivateKey, KeyAlgorithm,\\n} from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst privateKey = PrivateKey.generate(KeyAlgorithm.ED25519);\\n\\nconst payload = TransactionV1Payload.build({\\n  initiatorAddr: new InitiatorAddr(privateKey.publicKey),\\n  chainName: 'casper',\\n  timestamp: new Timestamp(new Date()),\\n  ttl: Duration.fromJSON('30m'),\\n  args: Args.fromMap({ amount: newCLU512('2500000000') }),\\n  entryPoint: new TransactionEntryPoint(TransactionEntryPointEnum.Transfer),\\n  transactionTarget: new TransactionTarget({}),\\n  scheduling: new TransactionScheduling({}),\\n  pricingMode: (() => {\\n    const pm = new PricingMode();\\n    pm.paymentLimited = Object.assign(new PaymentLimitedMode(), {\\n      paymentAmount: 100_000_000,\\n      gasPriceTolerance: 1,\\n      standardPayment: true,\\n    });\\n    return pm;\\n  })(),\\n});\\n\\nconst tx = TransactionV1.newTransactionV1(payload);\\ntx.sign(privateKey);\\n```\\n\\n:::tip\\nUse transaction builders like `NativeTransferBuilder` instead of building payloads manually - they handle all of this automatically.\\n:::\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [Transaction Builders](/builders/introduction) - High-level API\\n- [`Transaction`](/types/transaction) - Wrapper type\\n- [`TransactionTarget`](/types/transaction-target) - Target field\\n- [`TransactionEntryPoint`](/types/transaction-entry-point) - Entry point field\\n- [`PricingMode`](/types/pricing-mode) - Pricing field\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-v1-payload#transactionv1payload\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>The payload of a Casper 2.x <code>TransactionV1</code>, containing all fields needed to build, sign, and submit a transaction.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-v1-payload.mdx#transactionv1payload\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nThe payload of a Casper 2.x TransactionV1, containing all fields needed to build, sign, and submit a transaction.\\n\",\"title\":\"TransactionV1Payload\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-v1-payload#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-v1-payload.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionV1Payload\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-v1-payload#interface\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-v1-payload.mdx#interface\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Interface\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionV1Payload\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-v1-payload#itransactionpayloadbuildparams\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Builder parameters for constructing a payload.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>initiatorAddr</code></td><td><code>InitiatorAddr</code></td><td>Who is sending the transaction</td></tr><tr><td><code>args</code></td><td><code>Args</code></td><td>Transaction arguments</td></tr><tr><td><code>ttl</code></td><td><code>Duration</code></td><td>Time-to-live</td></tr><tr><td><code>entryPoint</code></td><td><code>TransactionEntryPoint</code></td><td>Target entry point</td></tr><tr><td><code>pricingMode</code></td><td><code>PricingMode</code></td><td>Pricing strategy</td></tr><tr><td><code>timestamp</code></td><td><code>Timestamp</code></td><td>Creation timestamp</td></tr><tr><td><code>transactionTarget</code></td><td><code>TransactionTarget</code></td><td>Execution target</td></tr><tr><td><code>scheduling</code></td><td><code>TransactionScheduling</code></td><td>Scheduling strategy</td></tr><tr><td><code>chainName</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Target chain</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-v1-payload.mdx#itransactionpayloadbuildparams\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nBuilder parameters for constructing a payload.\\nPropertyTypeDescriptioninitiatorAddrInitiatorAddrWho is sending the transactionargsArgsTransaction argumentsttlDurationTime-to-liveentryPointTransactionEntryPointTarget entry pointpricingModePricingModePricing strategytimestampTimestampCreation timestamptransactionTargetTransactionTargetExecution targetschedulingTransactionSchedulingScheduling strategychainNamestringTarget chain\\n\",\"title\":\"ITransactionPayloadBuildParams\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionV1Payload\",\"Interface\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-v1-payload#classes\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-v1-payload.mdx#classes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Classes\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionV1Payload\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-v1-payload#transactionv1payload-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>initiatorAddr</code></td><td><code>InitiatorAddr</code></td><td>Transaction initiator</td></tr><tr><td><code>timestamp</code></td><td><code>Timestamp</code></td><td>Creation timestamp</td></tr><tr><td><code>ttl</code></td><td><code>Duration</code></td><td>Time-to-live</td></tr><tr><td><code>pricingMode</code></td><td><code>PricingMode</code></td><td>Pricing mode</td></tr><tr><td><code>chainName</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Chain name</td></tr><tr>