+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# PrivateKey\\n\\nRepresents a cryptographic private key for signing transactions and messages.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { PrivateKey, KeyAlgorithm } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// Generate a new key pair\\nconst privateKey = PrivateKey.generate(KeyAlgorithm.ED25519);\\nconsole.log(privateKey.publicKey.toHex());\\n// → '01a8b1...'\\n\\n// Sign a transaction\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\n```\\n\\n## Methods\\n\\n### PrivateKey.generate\\n\\nGenerates a new random private key.\\n\\n```ts\\nPrivateKey.generate(algorithm: KeyAlgorithm): PrivateKey\\n```\\n\\n#### Parameters\\n\\n##### algorithm\\n\\n- **Type:** `KeyAlgorithm`\\n\\nThe key algorithm to use. Either `KeyAlgorithm.ED25519` or `KeyAlgorithm.SECP256K1`.\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`PrivateKey`\\n\\n#### Example\\n\\n```ts\\nconst ed25519Key = PrivateKey.generate(KeyAlgorithm.ED25519);\\nconst secp256k1Key = PrivateKey.generate(KeyAlgorithm.SECP256K1);\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### PrivateKey.fromPem\\n\\nImports a private key from PEM format.\\n\\n```ts\\nPrivateKey.fromPem(content: string, algorithm: KeyAlgorithm): PrivateKey\\n```\\n\\n#### Parameters\\n\\n##### content\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nThe PEM-encoded private key string.\\n\\n##### algorithm\\n\\n- **Type:** `KeyAlgorithm`\\n\\nThe algorithm used by this key.\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`PrivateKey`\\n\\n#### Example\\n\\n```ts\\nconst pem = `-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\\nMC4CAQAwBQYDK2VwBCIEIMIUKy...\\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----`;\\n\\nconst privateKey = PrivateKey.fromPem(pem, KeyAlgorithm.ED25519);\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### PrivateKey.fromHex\\n\\nImports a private key from a hex string.\\n\\n```ts\\nPrivateKey.fromHex(key: string, algorithm: KeyAlgorithm): PrivateKey\\n```\\n\\n#### Parameters\\n\\n##### key\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nHex-encoded private key bytes.\\n\\n##### algorithm\\n\\n- **Type:** `KeyAlgorithm`\\n\\nThe algorithm used by this key.\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`PrivateKey`\\n\\n#### Example\\n\\n```ts\\nconst privateKey = PrivateKey.fromHex('a1b2c3...', KeyAlgorithm.ED25519);\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### toPem\\n\\nExports the private key as a PEM string.\\n\\n```ts\\nprivateKey.toPem(): string\\n```\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`string` - PEM-encoded private key, safe for file storage.\\n\\n#### Example\\n\\n```ts\\nconst pem = privateKey.toPem();\\n// Store securely\\nfs.writeFileSync('secret_key.pem', pem, { mode: 0o600 });\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### toBytes\\n\\nReturns the raw private key bytes.\\n\\n```ts\\nprivateKey.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### sign\\n\\nSigns a message with this private key.\\n\\n```ts\\nprivateKey.sign(message: Uint8Array): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n#### Parameters\\n\\n##### message\\n\\n- **Type:** `Uint8Array`\\n\\nThe bytes to sign (typically a transaction hash).\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`Uint8Array` - The signature bytes (64 bytes for ED25519, 64 bytes for SECP256K1).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Properties\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `publicKey` | `PublicKey` | The corresponding public key |\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/accounts/private-key#privatekey\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Represents a cryptographic private key for signing transactions and messages.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/accounts/private-key.mdx#privatekey\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nRepresents a cryptographic private key for signing transactions and messages.\\n\",\"title\":\"PrivateKey\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/accounts/private-key#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/accounts/private-key.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"PrivateKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/accounts/private-key#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Generate a new key pair</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> privateKey</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> PrivateKey.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">generate</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(KeyAlgorithm.</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">ED25519</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey.publicKey.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toHex</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">());</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// → &#x27;01a8b1...&#x27;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Sign a transaction</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/accounts/private-key.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// Generate a new key pair\\nconst pri