+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getValidatorChangesInfo\\n\\nReturns a list of validators whose status changed in the most recent era.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getValidatorChangesInfo();\\n\\nfor (const change of result.changes) {\\n  console.log('Validator:', change.publicKey.toHex());\\n  console.log('Status changes:', change.statusChanges);\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<InfoGetValidatorChangesResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface InfoGetValidatorChangesResult {\\n  changes: ValidatorChange[];\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getLatestAuctionInfo`](/actions/auction/getLatestAuctionInfo)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getValidatorChangesInfo#getvalidatorchangesinfo\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns a list of validators whose status changed in the most recent era.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getValidatorChangesInfo.mdx#getvalidatorchangesinfo\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns a list of validators whose status changed in the most recent era.\\n\",\"title\":\"getValidatorChangesInfo\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getValidatorChangesInfo#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getValidatorChangesInfo.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getValidatorChangesInfo\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getValidatorChangesInfo#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"