+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getLatestDelegatorReward\\n\\nReturns the reward earned by a delegator in the most recent completed era.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler, PublicKey } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst reward = await rpcClient.getLatestDelegatorReward(\\n  validatorPublicKey,\\n  delegatorPublicKey\\n);\\n\\nconsole.log('Delegator reward:', reward.reward.toString(), 'motes');\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### validator\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey`\\n\\nThe validator the delegator is staking with.\\n\\n### delegator\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey`\\n\\nThe delegator's public key.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<InfoGetRewardResult>`\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getLatestValidatorReward`](/actions/auction/getLatestValidatorReward)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward#getlatestdelegatorreward\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the reward earned by a delegator in the most recent completed era.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward.mdx#getlatestdelegatorreward\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the reward earned by a delegator in the most recent completed era.\\n\",\"title\":\"getLatestDelegatorReward\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestDelegatorReward\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> reward</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getLatestDelegatorReward</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  validatorPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  delegatorPublicKey</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Delegator reward:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, reward.reward.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toString</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(), </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;motes&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst reward = await rpcClient.getLatestDelegatorReward(\\n  validatorPublicKey,\\n  delegatorPublicKey\\n);\\n \\nconsole.log(&#x27;Delegator reward:&#x27;, reward.reward.toString(), &#x27;motes&#x27;);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestDelegatorReward\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestDelegatorReward\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward#validator\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The validator the delegator is staking with.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward.mdx#validator\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey\\n\\nThe validator the delegator is staking with.\\n\",\"title\":\"validator\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestDelegatorReward\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward#delegator\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The delegator&#x27;s public key.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward.mdx#delegator\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey\\n\\nThe delegator&#x27;s public key.\\n\",\"title\":\"delegator\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestDelegatorReward\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Promise</code></p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nPromise\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestDelegatorReward\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/auction/getLatestValidatorReward\\\"><code>getLatestValidatorReward</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestDelegatorReward.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\ngetLatestValidatorReward\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestDelegatorReward\"]}]}}"
