+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getDeploy\\n\\nRetrieves a legacy deploy by its hash.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getDeploy('abc123def456...');\\n\\nconst deploy = result.deploy;\\nconst execResult = result.executionResults[0];\\n\\nif (execResult?.result.success) {\\n  console.log('Deploy succeeded');\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### hash\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nThe deploy hash as a hex string.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<InfoGetDeployResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface InfoGetDeployResult {\\n  deploy: Deploy;\\n  executionResults: DeployExecutionResult[];\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getTransactionByDeployHash`](/actions/transactions/getTransactionByDeployHash)\\n- [`putDeploy`](/actions/transactions/putDeploy)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/getDeploy#getdeploy\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Retrieves a legacy deploy by its hash.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/getDeploy.mdx#getdeploy\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nRetrieves a legacy deploy by its hash.\\n\",\"title\":\"getDeploy\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/getDeploy#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/getDeploy.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/getDeploy#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;abc123def456...&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> deploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> result.deploy;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> execResult</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> result.executionResults[</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">0</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">];</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (execResult?.result.success) {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Deploy succeeded&#x27;</span><span style=