+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getTransactionByDeployHash\\n\\nRetrieves a transaction by its legacy deploy hash, returning it in the unified `Transaction` wrapper.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getTransactionByDeployHash('abc123...');\\n\\nconst tx = result.transaction;\\n// The transaction wraps the deploy in Transaction format\\nconst deploy = tx.getDeploy();\\nconsole.log(deploy?.hash.toHex());\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### hash\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nThe deploy hash as a hex string.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<InfoGetTransactionResult>`\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getDeploy`](/actions/transactions/getDeploy)\\n- [`getTransactionByTransactionHash`](/actions/transactions/getTransactionByTransactionHash)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/getTransactionByDeployHash#gettransactionbydeployhash\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Retrieves a transaction by its legacy deploy hash, returning it in the unified <code>Transaction</code> wrapper.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/getTransactionByDeployHash.mdx#gettransactionbydeployhash\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nRetrieves a transaction by its legacy deploy hash, returning it in the unified Transaction wrapper.\\n\",\"title\":\"getTransactionByDeployHash\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/getTransactionByDeployHash#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/getTransactionByDeployHash.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getTransactionByDeployHash\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/getTransactionByDeployHash#usage\",\"html\