+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getBlockTransfersByHeight\\n\\nReturns the transfers included in a specific block, identified by height.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getBlockTransfersByHeight(1_000_000);\\n\\nconsole.log(`Block has ${result.transfers.length} transfers`);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### height\\n\\n- **Type:** `number`\\n\\nBlock height.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<ChainGetBlockTransfersResult>`\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getLatestBlockTransfers`](/actions/block/getLatestBlockTransfers)\\n- [`getBlockTransfersByHash`](/actions/block/getBlockTransfersByHash)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getBlockTransfersByHeight#getblocktransfersbyheight\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the transfers included in a specific block, identified by height.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/block/getBlockTransfersByHeight.mdx#getblocktransfersbyheight\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the transfers included in a specific block, identified by height.\\n\",\"title\":\"getBlockTransfersByHeight\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getBlockTransfersByHeight#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/block/getBlockTransfersByHeight.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getBlockTransfersByHeight\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getBlockTransfersByHeight#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--