+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# NativeTransferBuilder\\n\\nBuilds a native CSPR transfer transaction (TransactionV1 format).\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { NativeTransferBuilder, PublicKey } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst transaction = new NativeTransferBuilder()\\n  .from(senderPublicKey)\\n  .target(recipientPublicKey)\\n  .amount('2500000000')   // 2.5 CSPR in motes\\n  .id(Date.now())         // transfer memo ID\\n  .chainName('casper')\\n  .payment(100_000_000)\\n  .build();\\n\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\n\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\nconsole.log('Hash:', result.transactionHash);\\n```\\n\\n## Methods\\n\\n### .from(publicKey)\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\nThe sender's public key.\\n\\n### .target(publicKey)\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\nThe recipient's public key.\\n\\n### .amount(motes)\\n\\n- **Type:** `BigNumber | string` - required\\n\\nTransfer amount in motes. 1 CSPR = 1,000,000,000 motes.\\n\\n### .id(transferId)\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - required\\n\\nTransfer memo ID. Used as a unique identifier for this transfer. Typically `Date.now()`.\\n\\n### .chainName(name)\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\n`'casper'` for mainnet, `'casper-test'` for testnet.\\n\\n### .payment(motes)\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - optional, default `100_000_000`\\n\\nGas payment in motes.\\n\\n### .ttl(milliseconds)\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - optional, default `1800000` (30 minutes)\\n\\nTransaction time-to-live in milliseconds.\\n\\n### .timestamp(ts)\\n\\n- **Type:** `Timestamp` - optional, default `new Timestamp(new Date())`\\n\\nTransaction timestamp. Create with `new Timestamp(new Date())`.\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { Timestamp } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst transaction = new NativeTransferBuilder()\\n  // ...\\n  .timestamp(new Timestamp(new Date()))\\n  .ttl(1800000) // 30 minutes in ms\\n  .build();\\n```\\n\\n### .build()\\n\\nReturns the built `Transaction`.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Transaction` wrapping a `TransactionV1`.\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Minimum transfer amount is `2_500_000_000` motes (2.5 CSPR) on mainnet.\\n- The recipient receives exactly `amount` motes; gas is paid separately from the sender's balance.\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`makeCsprTransferDeploy`](/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy) - legacy Deploy format\\n- [`CasperNetwork`](/utilities/CasperNetwork) - auto-selects format by version\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#nativetransferbuilder\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Builds a native CSPR transfer transaction (TransactionV1 format).</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#nativetransferbuilder\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nBuilds a native CSPR transfer transaction (TransactionV1 format).\\n\",\"title\":\"NativeTransferBuilder\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> transaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> NativeTransferBuilder</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">from</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(senderPublicKey)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">target</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(recipientPublicKey)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">amount</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;2500000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)   </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 2.5 CSPR in motes</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">id</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(Date.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">now</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">())         </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// transfer memo ID</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">chainName</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">payment</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">100_000_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">build</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(transaction);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Hash:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, result.transactionHash);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst transaction = new NativeTransferBuilder()\\n  .from(senderPublicKey)\\n  .target(recipientPublicKey)\\n  .amount(&#x27;2500000000&#x27;)   // 2.5 CSPR in motes\\n  .id(Date.now())         // transfer memo ID\\n  .chainName(&#x27;casper&#x27;)\\n  .payment(100_000_000)\\n  .build();\\n \\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\n \\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\nconsole.log(&#x27;Hash:&#x27;, result.transactionHash);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#methods\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#methods\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#frompublickey\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The sender&#x27;s public key.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#frompublickey\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey - required\\n\\nThe sender&#x27;s public key.\\n\",\"title\":\".from(publicKey)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#targetpublickey\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>PublicKey</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The recipient&#x27;s public key.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#targetpublickey\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: PublicKey - required\\n\\nThe recipient&#x27;s public key.\\n\",\"title\":\".target(publicKey)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#amountmotes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>BigNumber | string</code> - required</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Transfer amount in motes. 1 CSPR = 1,000,000,000 motes.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#amountmotes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: BigNumber | string - required\\n\\nTransfer amount in motes. 1 CSPR = 1,000,000,000 motes.\\n\",\"title\":\".amount(motes)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTr