l, default 1800000 (30 minutes)\\n\\nTransaction time-to-live in milliseconds.\\n\",\"title\":\".ttl(milliseconds)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#timestampts\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>Timestamp</code> - optional, default <code>new Timestamp(new Date())</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Transaction timestamp. Create with <code>new Timestamp(new Date())</code>.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> transaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> NativeTransferBuilder</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">  // ...</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">timestamp</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> Timestamp</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> Date</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()))</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">ttl</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">1800000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">) </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 30 minutes in ms</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">build</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#timestampts\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: Timestamp - optional, default new Timestamp(new Date())\\n\\nTransaction timestamp. Create with new Timestamp(new Date()).\\n \\n \\nconst transaction = new NativeTransferBuilder()\\n  // ...\\n  .timestamp(new Timestamp(new Date()))\\n  .ttl(1800000) // 30 minutes in ms\\n  .build();\\n\",\"title\":\".timestamp(ts)\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#build\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Returns the built <code>Transaction</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#build\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the built Transaction.\\n\",\"title\":\".build()\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Transaction</code> wrapping a <code>TransactionV1</code>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nTransaction wrapping a TransactionV1.\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>Minimum transfer amount is <code>2_500_000_000</code> motes (2.5 CSPR) on mainnet.</li>\\n<li>The recipient receives exactly <code>amount</code> motes; gas is paid separately from the sender&#x27;s balance.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nMinimum transfer amount is 2_500_000_000 motes (2.5 CSPR) on mainnet.\\nThe recipient receives exactly amount motes; gas is paid separately from the sender&#x27;s balance.\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/utilities/makeCsprTransferDeploy\\\"><code>makeCsprTransferDeploy</code></a> - legacy Deploy format</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/utilities/CasperNetwork\\\"><code>CasperNetwork</code></a> - auto-selects format by version</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/NativeTransferBuilder.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nmakeCsprTransferDeploy - legacy Deploy format\\nCasperNetwork - auto-selects format by version\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"NativeTransferBuilder\"]}]}}"
