st accountHash = publicKey.toAccountHashStr();\\nv5:\\nconst accountHash = publicKey.accountHash().toFormattedStr();\\n// → &#x27;account-hash-abc123...&#x27;\\n\",\"title\":\"Account hash\",\"titles\":[\"Migration Guide (v2 → v5)\",\"Key Changes\"]},{\"href\":\"/docs/migration-guide#putdeploy--puttransaction\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>v2:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> client.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(deploy);</span></span></code></pre>\\n<p>v5:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// For modern TransactionV1:</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(transaction);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// For legacy Deploy:</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(deploy);</span></span></code></pre>\",\"id\":\"pages/docs/migration-guide.mdx#putdeploy--puttransaction\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nv2:\\nawait client.putDeploy(deploy);\\nv5:\\n// For modern TransactionV1:\\nawait rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n \\n// For legacy Deploy:\\nawait rpcClient.putDeploy(deploy);\",\"title\":\"putDeploy → putTransaction\",\"titles\":[\"Migration Guide (v2 → v5)\",\"Key Changes\"]}]}}"
