+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# UnbondingPurse\\n\\nRepresents a pending unbonding (unstaking) request for a validator or delegator.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { UnbondingPurse } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Class\\n\\n### `UnbondingPurse`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `amount` | `CLValueUInt512` | Amount being unbonded (in motes) |\\n| `bondingPurse` | `URef` | The purse the stake is being returned to |\\n| `eraOfCreation` | `number` | Era in which the unbonding was requested |\\n| `unbonderPublicKey` | `PublicKey` | Public key of the entity unbonding |\\n| `validatorPublicKey` | `PublicKey` | Public key of the validator being unbonded from |\\n| `newValidator?` | `PublicKey` | New validator (only set during redelegation) |\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// UnbondingPurse appears in StoredValue.withdraw and StoredValue.unbonding\\nconst result = await client.queryLatestGlobalState({\\n  key: 'account-hash-abc...',\\n  path: [],\\n});\\n\\nif (result.storedValue.withdraw) {\\n  for (const purse of result.storedValue.withdraw) {\\n    console.log('Unbonding:', purse.amount.toString(), 'motes');\\n    console.log('From validator:', purse.validatorPublicKey.toHex());\\n    console.log('Era:', purse.eraOfCreation);\\n\\n    if (purse.newValidator) {\\n      console.log('Redelegating to:', purse.newValidator.toHex());\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`StoredValue`](/types/stored-value) - Contains `withdraw` and `unbonding` fields\\n- [`Bid`](/types/bid) - Active staking bids\\n- [`NativeUndelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder) - Create an unbonding transaction\\n- [`NativeRedelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder) - Create a redelegation transaction\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/unbonding-purse#unbondingpurse\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Represents a pending unbonding (unstaking) request for a validator or delegator.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/unbonding-purse.mdx#unbondingpurse\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nRepresents a pending unbonding (unstaking) request for a validator or delegator.\\n\",\"title\":\"UnbondingPurse\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/unbonding-purse#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/unbonding-purse.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"UnbondingPurse\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/unbonding-purse#class\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/unbonding-purse.mdx#class\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Class\",\"titles\":[\"UnbondingPurse\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/unbonding-purse#unbondingpurse-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>amount</code></td><td><code>CLValueUInt512</code></td><td>Amount being unbonded (in motes)</td></tr><tr><td><code>bondingPurse</code></td><td><code>URef</code></td><td>The purse the stake is being returned to</td></tr><tr><td><code>eraOfCreation</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>Era in which the unbonding was requested</td></tr><tr><td><code>unbonderPublicKey</code></td><td><code>PublicKey</code></td><td>Public key of the entity unbonding</td></tr><tr><td><code>validatorPublicKey</code></td><td><code>PublicKey</code></td><td>Public key of the validator being unbonded from</td></tr><tr><td><code>newValidator?</code></td><td><code>PublicKey</code></td><td>New validator (only set during redelegation)</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/unbonding-purse.mdx#unbondingpurse-1\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nPropertyTypeDescriptionamountCLValueUInt512Amount being unbonded (in motes)bondingPurseURefThe purse the stake is being returned toeraOfCreationnumberEra in which the unbonding was requestedunbonderPublicKeyPublicKeyPublic key of the entity unbondingvalidatorPublicKeyPublicKeyPublic key of the validator being unbonded fromnewValidator?PublicKeyNew validator (only set during redelegation)\\n\",\"title\":\"UnbondingPurse\",\"titles\":[\"UnbondingPurse\",\"Class\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/unbonding-purse#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// UnbondingPurse appears in StoredValue.withdraw and StoredValue.unbonding</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> client.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">queryLatestGlobalState</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  key: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;account-hash-abc...&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  path: [],</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (result.storedValue.withdraw) {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  for</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> purse</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> of</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> result.storedValue.withdraw) {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">    console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Unbonding:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, purse.amount.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toString</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(), </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;motes&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">    console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;From validator:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, purse.validatorPublicKey.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toHex</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">());</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">    console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Era:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, purse.eraOfCreation);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">    if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (purse.newValidator) {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">      console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Redelegating to:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, purse.newValidator.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toHex</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">());</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">    }</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  }</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">}</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/unbonding-purse.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// UnbondingPurse appears in StoredValue.withdraw and StoredValue.unbonding\\nconst result = await client.queryLatestGlobalState({\\n  key: &#x27;account-hash-abc...&#x27;,\\n  path: [],\\n});\\n \\nif (result.storedValue.withdraw) {\\n  for (const purse of result.storedValue.withdraw) {\\n    console.log(&#x27;Unbonding:&#x27;, purse.amount.toString(), &#x27;motes&#x27;);\\n    console.log(&#x27;From validator:&#x27;, purse.validatorPublicKey.toHex());\\n    console.log(&#x27;Era:&#x27;, purse.eraOfCreation);\\n \\n    if (purse.newValidator) {\\n      console.log(&#x27;Redelegating to:&#x27;, purse.newValidator.toHex());\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"UnbondingPurse\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/unbonding-purse#see-also\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/types/stored-value\\\"><code>StoredValue</code></a> - Contains <code>withdraw</code> and <code>unbonding</code> fields</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/types/bid\\\"><code>Bid</code></a> - Active staking bids</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeUndelegateBuilder</code></a> - Create an unbonding transaction</li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeRedelegateBuilder</code></a> - Create a redelegation transaction</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/types/unbonding-purse.mdx#see-also\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nStoredValue - Contains withdraw and unbonding fields\\nBid - Active staking bids\\nNativeUndelegateBuilder - Create an unbonding transaction\\nNativeRedelegateBuilder - Create a redelegation transaction\\n\",\"title\":\"See Also\",\"titles\":[\"UnbondingPurse\"]}]}}"
