+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# TransactionAccepted\\n\\nFires when a transaction is accepted into the node's mempool (before execution).\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { SseClient, EventName } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.TransactionAcceptedEventType, (raw) => {\\n  const result = raw.parseAsTransactionAcceptedEvent();\\n  if (result.err) return;\\n\\n  const tx = result.val.transactionAccepted;\\n\\n  const v1Hash = tx.getTransactionV1()?.hash.toHex();\\n  console.log('Accepted transaction hash:', v1Hash);\\n});\\n```\\n\\n## Payload\\n\\nThe payload wraps either a `TransactionV1` or a legacy `Deploy`.\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface TransactionAcceptedPayload {\\n  getTransactionV1(): TransactionV1 | undefined;\\n  getDeploy(): Deploy | undefined;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- This event fires before execution. A `TransactionAccepted` does **not** mean the transaction succeeded.\\n- Listen for [`TransactionProcessed`](/sse/transaction-processed) for the execution outcome.\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`TransactionProcessed`](/sse/transaction-processed)\\n- [`TransactionExpired`](/sse/transaction-expired)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-accepted#transactionaccepted\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Fires when a transaction is accepted into the node&#x27;s mempool (before execution).</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-accepted.mdx#transactionaccepted\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nFires when a transaction is accepted into the node&#x27;s mempool (before execution).\\n\",\"title\":\"TransactionAccepted\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-accepted#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-accepted.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionAccepted\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-accepted#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">sseClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">subscribe</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(EventName.TransactionAcceptedEventType, (</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">raw</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">=&gt;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> raw.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">parseAsTransactionAcceptedEvent</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  if</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> (result.err) </span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">return</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> tx</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> result.val.transactionAccepted;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> v1Hash</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> tx.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getTransactionV1</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()?.hash.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toHex</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Accepted transaction hash:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, v1Hash);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-accepted.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.TransactionAcceptedEventType, (raw) =&gt; {\\n  const result = raw.parseAsTransactionAcceptedEvent();\\n  if (result.err) return;\\n \\n  const tx = result.val.transactionAccepted;\\n \\n  const v1Hash = tx.getTransactionV1()?.hash.toHex();\\n  console.log(&#x27;Accepted transaction hash:&#x27;, v1Hash);\\n});\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionAccepted\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-accepted#payload\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>The payload wraps either a <code>TransactionV1</code> or a legacy <code>Deploy</code>.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">interface</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> TransactionAcceptedPayload</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">  getTransactionV1</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> TransactionV1</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> |</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> undefined</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">  getDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> Deploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> |</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> undefined</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">}</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-accepted.mdx#payload\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nThe payload wraps either a TransactionV1 or a legacy Deploy.\\ninterface TransactionAcceptedPayload {\\n  getTransactionV1(): TransactionV1 | undefined;\\n  getDeploy(): Deploy | undefined;\\n}\\n\",\"title\":\"Payload\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionAccepted\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-accepted#notes\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li>This event fires before execution. A <code>TransactionAccepted</code> does <strong>not</strong> mean the transaction succeeded.</li>\\n<li>Listen for <a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-processed\\\"><code>TransactionProcessed</code></a> for the execution outcome.</li>\\n</ul>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-accepted.mdx#notes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nThis event fires before execution. A TransactionAccepted does not mean the transaction succeeded.\\nListen for TransactionProcessed for the execution outcome.\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Notes\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionAccepted\"]},{\"href\":\"/sse/transaction-accepted#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-processed\\\"><code>TransactionProcessed</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/sse/transaction-expired\\\"><code>TransactionExpired</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/transaction-accepted.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nTransactionProcessed\\nTransactionExpired\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionAccepted\"]}]}}"
