+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# makeAuctionManagerTransaction\\n\\nCreates a `Transaction` (TransactionV1 format) for auction operations.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { makeAuctionManagerTransaction, AuctionManagerEntryPoint } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst transaction = makeAuctionManagerTransaction({\\n  entryPoint: AuctionManagerEntryPoint.delegate,\\n  delegator: delegatorPublicKey,\\n  validator: validatorPublicKey,\\n  amount: '500000000000',\\n  chainName: 'casper',\\n});\\n\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\nSame as [`makeAuctionManagerDeploy`](/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy).\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Transaction`\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`makeAuctionManagerDeploy`](/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy)\\n- [`NativeDelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction#makeauctionmanagertransaction\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a <code>Transaction</code> (TransactionV1 format) for auction operations.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction.mdx#makeauctionmanagertransaction\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a Transaction (TransactionV1 format) for auction operations.\\n\",\"title\":\"makeAuctionManagerTransaction\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"makeAuctionManagerTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> transaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> makeAuctionManagerTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  entryPoint: AuctionManagerEntryPoint.delegate,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  delegator: delegatorPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  validator: validatorPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  amount: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;500000000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  chainName: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(transaction);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst transaction = makeAuctionManagerTransaction({\\n  entryPoint: AuctionManagerEntryPoint.delegate,\\n  delegator: delegatorPublicKey,\\n  validator: validatorPublicKey,\\n  amount: &#x27;500000000000&#x27;,\\n  chainName: &#x27;casper&#x27;,\\n});\\n \\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"makeAuctionManagerTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Same as <a href=\\\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy\\\"><code>makeAuctionManagerDeploy</code></a>.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nSame as makeAuctionManagerDeploy.\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"makeAuctionManagerTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Transaction</code></p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nTransaction\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"makeAuctionManagerTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy\\\"><code>makeAuctionManagerDeploy</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeDelegateBuilder</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nmakeAuctionManagerDeploy\\nNativeDelegateBuilder\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"makeAuctionManagerTransaction\"]}]}}"
