+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# InitiatorAddr\\n\\nIdentifies the initiator of a transaction - either by public key or account hash.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { InitiatorAddr } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Class\\n\\n### `InitiatorAddr`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `publicKey?` | `PublicKey` | Initiator's public key |\\n| `accountHash?` | `AccountHash` | Initiator's account hash |\\n\\n#### Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew InitiatorAddr(publicKey?: PublicKey, accountHash?: AccountHash)\\n```\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\naddr.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\naddr.toJSON(): unknown\\nInitiatorAddr.fromJSON(json: any): InitiatorAddr\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { InitiatorAddr, PublicKey } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\n// From public key\\nconst addr = new InitiatorAddr(somePublicKey);\\n\\n// From JSON (as returned by RPC)\\nconst addr2 = InitiatorAddr.fromJSON({\\n  PublicKey: '01abc...'\\n});\\n\\n// Or account hash\\nconst addr3 = InitiatorAddr.fromJSON({\\n  AccountHash: 'account-hash-abc...'\\n});\\n\\n// Check which type it is\\nif (addr2.publicKey) {\\n  console.log('Public key initiator:', addr2.publicKey.toHex());\\n} else if (addr2.accountHash) {\\n  console.log('Account hash initiator:', addr2.accountHash.toHex());\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`Transaction`](/types/transaction) - Uses `InitiatorAddr`\\n- [`ExecutionResult`](/types/execution-result) - Contains `initiator: InitiatorAddr`\\n- [`TransactionV1Payload`](/types/transaction-v1-payload) - Payload field\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/initiator-addr#initiatoraddr\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Identifies the initiator of a transaction - either by public key or account hash.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/initiator-addr.mdx#initiatoraddr\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nIdentifies the initiator of a transaction - either by public key or account hash.\\n\",\"title\":\"InitiatorAddr\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/initiator-addr#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre