+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# PricingMode\\n\\nSpecifies how a transaction's execution cost is calculated and paid. Casper 2.x supports three pricing modes.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { PricingMode, PaymentLimitedMode, FixedMode, PrepaidMode } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Classes\\n\\n### `PricingMode`\\n\\nA discriminated union - exactly one mode is active.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `paymentLimited?` | `PaymentLimitedMode` | Classic payment with an explicit amount |\\n| `fixed?` | `FixedMode` | Fixed-cost execution |\\n| `prepaid?` | `PrepaidMode` | Pre-paid via a receipt |\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\npricingMode.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n### `PaymentLimitedMode`\\n\\nClassic payment model: the caller sets a maximum payment amount.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `gasPriceTolerance` | `number` | Maximum acceptable gas price multiplier |\\n| `paymentAmount` | `number` | Maximum payment in motes |\\n| `standardPayment` | `boolean` | Whether to use the standard payment contract |\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nmode.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n### `FixedMode`\\n\\nFixed-cost execution - used by the system for auction and mint transactions.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `gasPriceTolerance` | `number` | Maximum acceptable gas price multiplier |\\n| `additionalComputationFactor` | `number` | Extra computation factor |\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nmode.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n### `PrepaidMode`\\n\\nExecution paid for by a pre-purchased receipt.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `receipt` | `Hash` | Pre-payment receipt hash |\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nmode.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { PricingMode, PaymentLimitedMode, FixedMode } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\n// Payment limited mode (most common for user transactions)\\nconst paymentLimited = new PricingMode();\\npaymentLimited.paymentLimited = new PaymentLimitedMode();\\npaymentLimited.paymentLimited.paymentAmount = 100_000_000;\\npaymentLimited.paymentLimited.gasPriceTolerance = 1;\\npaymentLimited.paymentLimited.standardPayment = true;\\n\\n// Fixed mode (for auction/mint calls)\\nconst fixed = new PricingMode();\\nfixed.fixed = new FixedMode();\\nfixed.fixed.gasPriceTolerance = 1;\\nfixed.fixed.additionalComputationFactor = 0;\\n```\\n\\n:::tip\\nTransaction builders like `NativeTransferBuilder` set the pricing mode automatically. You only need to configure it manually when building raw `TransactionV1Payload` objects.\\n:::\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`TransactionV1Payload`](/types/transaction-v1-payload) - Uses `PricingMode`\\n- [Transaction Builders](/builders/introduction) - Handle pricing automatically\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#pricingmode\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Specifies how a transaction&#x27;s execution cost is calculated and paid. Casper 2.x supports three pricing modes.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#pricingmode\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nSpecifies how a transaction&#x27;s execution cost is calculated and paid. Casper 2.x supports three pricing modes.\\n\",\"title\":\"PricingMode\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#classes\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#classes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Classes\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#pricingmode-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>A discriminated union - exactly one mode is active.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>paymentLimited?</code></td><td><code>PaymentLimitedMode</code></td><td>Classic payment with an explicit amount</td></tr><tr><td><code>fixed?</code></td><td><code>FixedMode</code></td><td>Fixed-cost execution</td></tr><tr><td><code>prepaid?</code></td><td><code>PrepaidMode</code></td><td>Pre-paid via a receipt</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#pricingmode-1\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nA discriminated union - exactly one mode is active.\\nPropertyTypeDescriptionpaymentLimited?PaymentLimitedModeClassic payment with an explicit amountfixed?FixedModeFixed-cost executionprepaid?PrepaidModePre-paid via a receipt\\n\",\"title\":\"PricingMode\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\",\"Classes\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#methods\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">pricingMode.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(): Uint8Array</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#methods\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\npricingMode.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\",\"Classes\",\"PricingMode\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#paymentlimitedmode\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Classic payment model: the caller sets a maximum payment amount.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>gasPriceTolerance</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>Maximum acceptable gas price multiplier</td></tr><tr><td><code>paymentAmount</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>Maximum payment in motes</td></tr><tr><td><code>standardPayment</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>Whether to use the standard payment contract</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#paymentlimitedmode\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nClassic payment model: the caller sets a maximum payment amount.\\nPropertyTypeDescriptiongasPriceTolerancenumberMaximum acceptable gas price multiplierpaymentAmountnumberMaximum payment in motesstandardPaymentbooleanWhether to use the standard payment contract\\n\",\"title\":\"PaymentLimitedMode\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\",\"Classes\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#methods-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">mode.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(): Uint8Array</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#methods-1\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nmode.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\",\"Classes\",\"PaymentLimitedMode\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#fixedmode\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Fixed-cost execution - used by the system for auction and mint transactions.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>gasPriceTolerance</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>Maximum acceptable gas price multiplier</td></tr><tr><td><code>additionalComputationFactor</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>Extra computation factor</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#fixedmode\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nFixed-cost execution - used by the system for auction and mint transactions.\\nPropertyTypeDescriptiongasPriceTolerancenumberMaximum acceptable gas price multiplieradditionalComputationFactornumberExtra computation factor\\n\",\"title\":\"FixedMode\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\",\"Classes\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#methods-2\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">mode.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(): Uint8Array</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#methods-2\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nmode.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\",\"Classes\",\"FixedMode\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#prepaidmode\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Execution paid for by a pre-purchased receipt.</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>receipt</code></td><td><code>Hash</code></td><td>Pre-payment receipt hash</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/pricing-mode.mdx#prepaidmode\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nExecution paid for by a pre-purchased receipt.\\nPropertyTypeDescriptionreceiptHashPre-payment receipt hash\\n\",\"title\":\"PrepaidMode\",\"titles\":[\"PricingMode\",\"Classes\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/pricing-mode#methods-3\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">mode.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(): Uint8Array</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/ty