+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# SpeculativeClient\\n\\nThe `SpeculativeClient` allows dry-running transactions against the current chain state without submitting them on-chain.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { SpeculativeClient, HttpHandler, IHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// Speculative execution uses port 7778\\nconst handler = new HttpHandler('http://<Node Address>:7778/rpc');\\nconst speculativeClient = SpeculativeClient.newSpeculativeClient(handler);\\n\\nconst result = await speculativeClient.speculativeExec('1', deploy);\\nconsole.log('Execution effect:', result.executionResult);\\n```\\n\\n## Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew SpeculativeClient(handler: IHandler)\\n```\\n\\nThe constructor takes any `IHandler` implementation. Use the static factory for convenience:\\n\\n```ts\\nSpeculativeClient.newSpeculativeClient(handler: IHandler): SpeculativeClient\\n```\\n\\n### Parameters\\n\\n#### handler\\n\\n- **Type:** `IHandler`\\n\\nThe HTTP transport pointing to port `7778` on the node.\\n\\n## Methods\\n\\n### speculativeExec\\n\\n```ts\\nspeculativeClient.speculativeExec(\\n  reqID: string,\\n  deploy: Deploy,\\n  identifier?: BlockIdentifier\\n): Promise<SpeculativeExecResult>\\n```\\n\\nExecutes a deploy speculatively. The transaction is **not** written to the chain.\\n\\n### Parameters\\n\\n#### reqID\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nA unique request ID string for this speculative execution call.\\n\\n#### deploy\\n\\n- **Type:** `Deploy`\\n\\nThe legacy deploy to execute speculatively.\\n\\n#### identifier\\n\\n- **Type:** `BlockIdentifier` (optional)\\n\\nThe block to execute against. Defaults to the latest block.\\n\\n### Return Value\\n\\n`SpeculativeExecResult`\\n\\nContains the execution result and effects that would have occurred.\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\n- Not all nodes expose port 7778 - check with your node operator.\\n- The speculative execution state is based on the current latest block.\\n- Use this to estimate gas costs or verify contract logic before submitting.\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#speculativeclient\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>The <code>SpeculativeClient</code> allows dry-running transactions against the current chain state without submitting them on-chain.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#speculativeclient\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nThe SpeculativeClient allows dry-running transactions against the current chain state without submitting them on-chain.\\n\",\"title\":\"SpeculativeClient\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Speculative execution uses port 7778</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> handler</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> HttpHandler</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;http://:7778/rpc&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> speculativeClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> SpeculativeClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">newSpeculativeClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(handler);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> speculativeClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">speculativeExec</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;1&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, deploy);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Execution effect:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, result.executionResult);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// Speculative execution uses port 7778\\nconst handler = new HttpHandler(&#x27;http://:7778/rpc&#x27;);\\nconst speculativeClient = SpeculativeClient.newSpeculativeClient(handler);\\n \\nconst result = await speculativeClient.speculativeExec(&#x27;1&#x27;, deploy);\\nconsole.log(&#x27;Execution effect:&#x27;, result.executionResult);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#constructor\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> SpeculativeClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(handler: IHandler)</span></span></code></pre>\\n<p>The constructor takes any <code>IHandler</code> implementation. Use the static factory for convenience:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">SpeculativeClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">newSpeculativeClient</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(handler: IHandler): SpeculativeClient</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#constructor\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nnew SpeculativeClient(handler: IHandler)\\nThe constructor takes any IHandler implementation. Use the static factory for convenience:\\nSpeculativeClient.newSpeculativeClient(handler: IHandler): SpeculativeClient\\n\",\"title\":\"Constructor\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\",\"Constructor\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#handler\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>IHandler</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The HTTP transport pointing to port <code>7778</code> on the node.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#handler\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: IHandler\\n\\nThe HTTP transport pointing to port 7778 on the node.\\n\",\"title\":\"handler\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\",\"Constructor\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#methods\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#methods\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#speculativeexec\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">speculativeClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">speculativeExec</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  reqID: string,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  deploy: Deploy,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  identifier</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">?:</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> BlockIdentifier</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">): </span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">Promise</span></span></code></pre>\\n<p>Executes a deploy speculatively. The transaction is <strong>not</strong> written to the chain.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#speculativeexec\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nspeculativeClient.speculativeExec(\\n  reqID: string,\\n  deploy: Deploy,\\n  identifier?: BlockIdentifier\\n): Promise\\nExecutes a deploy speculatively. The transaction is not written to the chain.\\n\",\"title\":\"speculativeExec\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#parameters-1\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#parameters-1\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\",\"Methods\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#reqid\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>A unique request ID string for this speculative execution call.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#reqid\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string\\n\\nA unique request ID string for this speculative execution call.\\n\",\"title\":\"reqID\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\",\"Methods\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#deploy\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>Deploy</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The legacy deploy to execute speculatively.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#deploy\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: Deploy\\n\\nThe legacy deploy to execute speculatively.\\n\",\"title\":\"deploy\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\",\"Methods\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#identifier\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>BlockIdentifier</code> (optional)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The block to execute against. Defaults to the latest block.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#identifier\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: BlockIdentifier (optional)\\n\\nThe block to execute against. Defaults to the latest block.\\n\",\"title\":\"identifier\",\"titles\":[\"SpeculativeClient\",\"Methods\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/clients/speculative#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>SpeculativeExecResult</code></p>\\n<p>Contains the execution result and effects that would have occurred.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/clients/speculative.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\