+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getEraSummaryLatest\\n\\nReturns a summary of the current era, including era ID and validator weights.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getEraSummaryLatest();\\n\\nconsole.log('Era ID:', result.eraSummary.eraId);\\nconsole.log('Block hash:', result.eraSummary.blockHash);\\n```\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<ChainGetEraSummaryResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface ChainGetEraSummaryResult {\\n  eraSummary: EraSummary;\\n}\\n\\ninterface EraSummary {\\n  eraId: number;\\n  blockHash: Hash;\\n  storedValue: StoredValue; // EraInfo\\n  stateRootHash: Hash;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getLatestAuctionInfo`](/actions/auction/getLatestAuctionInfo)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getEraSummaryLatest#geterasummarylatest\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns a summary of the current era, including era ID and validator weights.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getEraSummaryLatest.mdx#geterasummarylatest\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns a summary of the current era, including era ID and validator weights.\\n\",\"title\":\"getEraSummaryLatest\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getEraSummaryLatest#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getEraSummaryLatest.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getEraSummaryLatest\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getEraSummaryLatest#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code