+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# FinalitySignature\\n\\nFires when a validator submits a finality signature for a block.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { SseClient, EventName } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nsseClient.subscribe(EventName.FinalitySignatureEventType, (raw) => {\\n  const result = raw.parseAsFinalitySignatureEvent();\\n  if (result.err) return;\\n\\n  const sig = result.val.finalitySignature;\\n\\n  // Casper 2.x\\n  const v2 = sig.getFinalitySignatureV2();\\n  if (v2) {\\n    console.log('Block hash:', v2.blockHash);\\n    console.log('Validator:', v2.publicKey.toHex());\\n    console.log('Chain name hash:', v2.chainNameHash);\\n    console.log('Signature:', v2.signature);\\n  }\\n\\n  // Casper 1.x\\n  const v1 = sig.getFinalitySignatureV1();\\n  if (v1) {\\n    console.log('Block hash:', v1.blockHash);\\n    console.log('Validator:', v1.publicKey.toHex());\\n  }\\n});\\n```\\n\\n## Payload\\n\\nThe `FinalitySignature` wrapper holds either a V1 or V2 signature.\\n\\n| Method | Returns |\\n|---|---|\\n| `getFinalitySignatureV2()` | `FinalitySignatureV2 \\\\| undefined` |\\n| `getFinalitySignatureV1()` | `FinalitySignatureV1 \\\\| undefined` |\\n\\n### FinalitySignatureV2 Fields\\n\\n| Field | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `blockHash` | `string` | Signed block hash |\\n| `blockHeight` | `number` | Block height |\\n| `chainNameHash` | `string` | Hash of the chain name |\\n| `era` | `number` | Era ID |\\n| `publicKey` | `PublicKey` | Signing validator's key |\\n| `signature` | `string` | Hex-encoded signature |\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/sse/finality-signature#finalitysignature\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Fires when a validator submits a finality signature for a block.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/sse/finality-signature.mdx#finalitysignature\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nFires when a validator submits a finality signature for a block.\\n\",\"title\":\"FinalitySignature\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/sse/finality-signature