+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# ByteConverters\\n\\nLow-level utility functions for serializing numbers and data structures to and from byte arrays in little-endian format.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport {\\n  toBytesU8, toBytesU32, toBytesU64, toBytesU512,\\n  toBytesString, fromBytesString,\\n  byteHash,\\n} from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Functions\\n\\n### Integer Serialization\\n\\nAll integer functions produce little-endian `Uint8Array` output.\\n\\n```ts\\ntoBytesU8(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array    // 1 byte\\ntoBytesU16(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 2 bytes\\ntoBytesI32(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 4 bytes, signed\\ntoBytesU32(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 4 bytes\\ntoBytesU64(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 8 bytes\\ntoBytesI64(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 8 bytes, signed\\ntoBytesU128(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  // variable-length\\ntoBytesU256(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  // variable-length\\ntoBytesU512(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  // variable-length\\n```\\n\\n### String Serialization\\n\\nStrings are serialized with a u32 length prefix (4 bytes) followed by UTF-8 bytes.\\n\\n```ts\\ntoBytesString(str: string): Uint8Array\\nfromBytesString(bytes: Uint8Array): string\\n```\\n\\n### Array Serialization\\n\\n```ts\\ntoBytesArrayU8(arr: Uint8Array): Uint8Array  // u32 length + bytes\\n```\\n\\n### Parsing\\n\\n```ts\\nparseU16(bytes: Uint8Array): number\\nparseU32(bytes: Uint8Array): number\\nfromBytesU64(bytes: Uint8Array): BigNumber\\n```\\n\\n### Hashing\\n\\n```ts\\nbyteHash(x: Uint8Array): Uint8Array  // Blake2b 256-bit hash\\n```\\n\\n### DataView Helpers\\n\\n```ts\\nwriteInteger(view: DataView, offset: number, value: number): number\\nwriteUShort(view: DataView, offset: number, value: number): number\\nwriteBytes(view: DataView, offset: number, value: Uint8Array): number\\nexpandBuffer(currentBuffer: ArrayBuffer, requiredSize: number): ArrayBuffer\\n```\\n\\n### Factory\\n\\n```ts\\n// Create a serializer for any integer type\\ntoBytesNumber(bitSize: number, signed: boolean): (value: BigNumberish) => Uint8Array\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { toBytesU32, toBytesU64, toBytesString, fromBytesString, byteHash } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\n// Serialize a u32\\nconst bytes = toBytesU32(42);\\n// Uint8Array [42, 0, 0, 0]\\n\\n// Serialize a string\\nconst strBytes = toBytesString('hello');\\n// [5, 0, 0, 0, 104, 101, 108, 108, 111]\\n\\nconst str = fromBytesString(strBytes);\\n// 'hello'\\n\\n// Compute a Blake2b hash\\nconst hash = byteHash(new Uint8Array([1, 2, 3]));\\n// Uint8Array(32) [...]\\n```\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`Conversions`](/types/conversions) - Base64/hex encoding and CSPR↔motes conversion\\n- [`HexBytes`](/types/hex-bytes) - Hex string wrapper\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#byteconverters\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Low-level utility functions for serializing numbers and data structures to and from byte arrays in little-endian format.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#byteconverters\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nLow-level utility functions for serializing numbers and data structures to and from byte arrays in little-endian format.\\n\",\"title\":\"ByteConverters\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  toBytesU8, toBytesU32, toBytesU64, toBytesU512,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  toBytesString, fromBytesString,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  byteHash,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">} from </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper-js-sdk&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n  toBytesU8, toBytesU32, toBytesU64, toBytesU512,\\n  toBytesString, fromBytesString,\\n  byteHash,\\n} from &#x27;casper-js-sdk&#x27;;\\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"ByteConverters\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#functions\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#functions\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Functions\",\"titles\":[\"ByteConverters\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#integer-serialization\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>All integer functions produce little-endian <code>Uint8Array</code> output.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesU8</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array    </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 1 byte</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesU16</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 2 bytes</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesI32</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 4 bytes, signed</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesU32</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 4 bytes</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesU64</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 8 bytes</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesI64</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 8 bytes, signed</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesU128</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// variable-length</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesU256</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// variable-length</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesU512</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// variable-length</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#integer-serialization\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nAll integer functions produce little-endian Uint8Array output.\\ntoBytesU8(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array    // 1 byte\\ntoBytesU16(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 2 bytes\\ntoBytesI32(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 4 bytes, signed\\ntoBytesU32(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 4 bytes\\ntoBytesU64(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 8 bytes\\ntoBytesI64(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array   // 8 bytes, signed\\ntoBytesU128(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  // variable-length\\ntoBytesU256(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  // variable-length\\ntoBytesU512(value: BigNumberish): Uint8Array  // variable-length\\n\",\"title\":\"Integer Serialization\",\"titles\":[\"ByteConverters\",\"Functions\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#string-serialization\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Strings are serialized with a u32 length prefix (4 bytes) followed by UTF-8 bytes.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesString</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(str: string): Uint8Array</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">fromBytesString</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(bytes: Uint8Array): string</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#string-serialization\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nStrings are serialized with a u32 length prefix (4 bytes) followed by UTF-8 bytes.\\ntoBytesString(str: string): Uint8Array\\nfromBytesString(bytes: Uint8Array): string\\n\",\"title\":\"String Serialization\",\"titles\":[\"ByteConverters\",\"Functions\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#array-serialization\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytesArrayU8</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(arr: Uint8Array): Uint8Array  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// u32 length + bytes</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#array-serialization\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\ntoBytesArrayU8(arr: Uint8Array): Uint8Array  // u32 length + bytes\\n\",\"title\":\"Array Serialization\",\"titles\":[\"ByteConverters\",\"Functions\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#parsing\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">parseU16</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(bytes: Uint8Array): number</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">parseU32</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(bytes: Uint8Array): number</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">fromBytesU64</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(bytes: Uint8Array): BigNumber</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#parsing\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nparseU16(bytes: Uint8Array): number\\nparseU32(bytes: Uint8Array): number\\nfromBytesU64(bytes: Uint8Array): BigNumber\\n\",\"title\":\"Parsing\",\"titles\":[\"ByteConverters\",\"Functions\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#hashing\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">byteHash</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(x: Uint8Array): Uint8Array  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Blake2b 256-bit hash</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#hashing\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nbyteHash(x: Uint8Array): Uint8Array  // Blake2b 256-bit hash\\n\",\"title\":\"Hashing\",\"titles\":[\"ByteConverters\",\"Functions\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#dataview-helpers\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">writeInteger</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(view: DataView, offset: number, value: number): number</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">writeUShort</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(view: DataView, offset: number, value: number): number</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">writeBytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(view: DataView, offset: number, value: Uint8Array): number</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">expandBuffer</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(currentBuffer: ArrayBuffer, requiredSize: number): ArrayBuffer</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/byte-converters.mdx#dataview-helpers\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nwriteInteger(view: DataView, offset: number, value: number): number\\nwriteUShort(view: DataView, offset: number, value: number): number\\nwriteBytes(view: DataView, offset: number, value: Uint8Array): number\\nexpandBuffer(currentBuffer: ArrayBuffer, requiredSize: number): ArrayBuffer\\n\",\"title\":\"DataView Helpers\",\"titles\":[\"ByteConverters\",\"Functions\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/byte-converters#factory\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-