+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getStatus\\n\\nReturns the current status and metadata of the connected node.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst status = await rpcClient.getStatus();\\n\\nconsole.log(status.chainspecName); // 'casper' or 'casper-test'\\nconsole.log(status.buildVersion);  // e.g., '2.0.0-abc1234'\\nconsole.log(status.isSyncing);     // false when fully synced\\nconsole.log(status.lastProgress?.timestamp); // latest block time\\n```\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<InfoGetStatusResult>`\\n\\n| Field | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `chainspecName` | `string` | Network name (`casper`, `casper-test`) |\\n| `buildVersion` | `string` | Node software version |\\n| `isSyncing` | `boolean` | Whether node is still syncing |\\n| `lastProgress` | `LastProgress` | Latest sync progress |\\n| `ourPublicSigningKey` | `PublicKey` | Node's own key (if validator) |\\n| `peers` | `Peer[]` | Connected peers summary |\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getPeers`](/actions/node/getPeers)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/node/getStatus#getstatus\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the current status and metadata of the connected node.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/node/getStatus.mdx#getstatus\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the current status and metadata of the connected node.\\n\",\"title\":\"getStatus\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/node/getStatus#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/node/getStatus.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getStatus\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/node/getStatus#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> status</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getStatus</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(status.chainspecName); </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// &#x27;casper&#x27; or &#x27;casper-test&#x27;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(status.buildVersion);  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// e.g., &#x27;2.0.0-abc1234&#x27;</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(status.isSyncing);     </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// false when fully synced</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(status.lastProgress?.timestamp); </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// latest block time</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/node/getStatus.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst status = await rpcClient.getStatus();\\n \\nconsole.log(status.chainspecName); // &#x27;casper&#x27; or &#x27;casper-test&#x27;\\nconsole.log(status.buildVersion);  // e.g., &#x27;2.0.0-abc1234&#x27;\\nconsole.log(status.isSyncing);     // false when fully synced\\nconsole.log(status.lastProgress?.timestamp); // latest block time\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"getStatus\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/node/getStatus#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Promise</code></p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>chainspecName</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Network name (<code>casper</code>, <code>casper-test</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>buildVersion</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Node software version</td></tr><tr><td><code>isSyncing</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>Whether node is still syncing</td></tr><tr><td><code>lastProgress</code></td><td><code>LastProgress</code></td><td>Latest sync progress</td></tr><tr><td><code>ourPublicSigningKey</code></td><td><code>PublicKey</code></td><td>Node&#x27;s own key (if validator)</td></tr><tr><td><code>peers</code></td><td><code>Peer[]</code></td><td>Connected peers summary</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/node/getStatus.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nPromise\\nFieldTypeDescriptionchainspecNamestringNetwork name (casper, casper-test)buildVersionstringNode software versionisSyncingbooleanWhether node is still syncinglastProgressLastProgressLatest sync progressourPublicSigningKeyPublicKeyNode&#x27;s own key (if validator)peersPeer[]Connected peers summary\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"getStatus\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/node/getStatus#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/node/getPeers\\\"><code>getPeers</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/node/getStatus.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\ngetPeers\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"getStatus\"]}]}}"
