+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# makeAuctionManagerDeploy\\n\\nCreates a legacy `Deploy` for auction (staking) operations: delegate, undelegate, or redelegate.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { makeAuctionManagerDeploy, AuctionManagerEntryPoint } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// Delegate\\nconst deploy = makeAuctionManagerDeploy({\\n  entryPoint: AuctionManagerEntryPoint.delegate,\\n  delegator: delegatorPublicKey,\\n  validator: validatorPublicKey,\\n  amount: '500000000000',  // 500 CSPR\\n  chainName: 'casper',\\n});\\n\\ndeploy.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putDeploy(deploy);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### entryPoint\\n\\n- **Type:** `AuctionManagerEntryPoint` - required\\n\\n```ts\\nenum AuctionManagerEntryPoint {\\n  delegate = 'delegate',\\n  undelegate = 'undelegate',\\n  redelegate = 'redelegate',\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### delegator\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\n### validator\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required\\n\\n### newValidator\\n\\n- **Type:** `PublicKey` - required for `redelegate` only\\n\\n### amount\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\n### chainName\\n\\n- **Type:** `string` - required\\n\\n### payment\\n\\n- **Type:** `number` - optional\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Deploy`\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`makeAuctionManagerTransaction`](/utilities/makeAuctionManagerTransaction) - TransactionV1 format\\n- [`NativeDelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy#makeauctionmanagerdeploy\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Creates a legacy <code>Deploy</code> for auction (staking) operations: delegate, undelegate, or redelegate.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy.mdx#makeauctionmanagerdeploy\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nCreates a legacy Deploy for auction (staking) operations: delegate, undelegate, or redelegate.\\n\",\"title\":\"makeAuctionManagerDeploy\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"makeAuctionManagerDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Delegate</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> deploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> makeAuctionManagerDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  entryPoint: AuctionManagerEntryPoint.delegate,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  delegator: delegatorPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  validator: validatorPublicKey,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  amount: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;500000000000&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// 500 CSPR</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  chainName: </span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">,</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">deploy.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putDeploy</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(deploy);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// Delegate\\nconst deploy = makeAuctionManagerDeploy({\\n  entryPoint: AuctionManagerEntryPoint.delegate,\\n  delegator: delegatorPublicKey,\\n  validator: validatorPublicKey,\\n  amount: &#x27;500000000000&#x27;,  // 500 CSPR\\n  chainName: &#x27;casper&#x27;,\\n});\\n \\ndeploy.sign(privateKey);\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putDeploy(deploy);\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"makeAuctionManagerDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"makeAuctionManagerDeploy\"]},{\"href\":\"/utilities/makeAuctionManagerDeploy#entrypoint\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><s