+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getBlockByHeight\\n\\nReturns a block at a specific height.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getBlockByHeight(1_000_000);\\n\\nconst block = result.block;\\nconsole.log(block.getBlockV2()?.header.timestamp);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### height\\n\\n- **Type:** `number`\\n\\nThe block height (0-indexed).\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<ChainGetBlockResult>`\\n\\nThrows `RpcError` with `ErrorCode.NoSuchBlock` if the height exceeds the current chain tip.\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getLatestBlock`](/actions/block/getLatestBlock)\\n- [`getBlockByHash`](/actions/block/getBlockByHash)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getBlockByHeight#getblockbyheight\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns a block at a specific height.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/block/getBlockByHeight.mdx#getblockbyheight\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns a block at a specific height.\\n\",\"title\":\"getBlockByHeight\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getBlockByHeight#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/block/getBlockByHeight.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getBlockByHeight\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getBlockByHeight#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"c