ckByHeight.mdx#height\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: number\\n\\nThe block height (0-indexed).\\n\",\"title\":\"height\",\"titles\":[\"getBlockByHeight\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getBlockByHeight#return-value\",\"html\":\"\\n<p><code>Promise</code></p>\\n<p>Throws <code>RpcError</code> with <code>ErrorCode.NoSuchBlock</code> if the height exceeds the current chain tip.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/block/getBlockByHeight.mdx#return-value\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nPromise\\nThrows RpcError with ErrorCode.NoSuchBlock if the height exceeds the current chain tip.\\n\",\"title\":\"Return Value\",\"titles\":[\"getBlockByHeight\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getBlockByHeight#related\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/block/getLatestBlock\\\"><code>getLatestBlock</code></a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/actions/block/getBlockByHash\\\"><code>getBlockByHash</code></a></li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/block/getBlockByHeight.mdx#related\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\ngetLatestBlock\\ngetBlockByHash\\n\",\"title\":\"Related\",\"titles\":[\"getBlockByHeight\"]}]}}"
