+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# Errors\\n\\nReference for all error types and codes in the Casper JS SDK.\\n\\n## RpcError\\n\\nThrown when the node returns a JSON-RPC error.\\n\\n```ts\\nclass RpcError extends Error {\\n  readonly code: number;     // ErrorCode value\\n  readonly data?: unknown;   // Optional additional info\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## ErrorCode\\n\\n| Constant | Value | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `NoSuchEntity` | -32001 | Account or entity not found (not funded) |\\n| `AccountMigratedToEntity` | -32002 | 1.x account migrated to 2.x entity format |\\n| `NoSuchBlock` | -32003 | Block hash or height not found |\\n| `NoSuchDeploy` | -32004 | Transaction or deploy hash not found |\\n| `FailedToGetBalance` | -32005 | Balance query failed |\\n\\n## HttpError\\n\\nThrown for HTTP transport failures.\\n\\n```ts\\nclass HttpError extends Error {\\n  readonly statusCode: number; // HTTP status (e.g., 503)\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## SSE Result Errors\\n\\nThe SSE client returns `Result<boolean, string>` from `ts-results`:\\n\\n| String | When |\\n|---|---|\\n| `'Already subscribed to this event'` | `subscribe()` called twice for same event |\\n| `'Not subscribed to this event'` | `unsubscribe()` called when not subscribed |\\n\\n## Custom Errors\\n\\n| Class | When thrown |\\n|---|---|\\n| `ErrInvalidPublicKeyAlgo` | Unknown key algorithm prefix byte |\\n| `ErrInvalidBidAddrTag` | Invalid BidAddr tag byte |\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/glossary/errors#errors\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Reference for all error types and codes in the Casper JS SDK.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/glossary/errors.mdx#errors\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReference for all error types and codes in the Casper JS SDK.\\n\",\"title\":\"Errors\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/glossary/errors#rpcerror\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Thrown when the node returns a JSON-RPC error.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">class</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> RpcError</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> extends</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> Error</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  readonly</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> code</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> number</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;     </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// ErrorCode value</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  readonly</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> data</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">?:</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> unknown</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">;   </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Optional additional info</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">}</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/glossary/errors.mdx#rpcerror\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nThrown when the node returns a JSON-RPC error.\\nclass RpcError extends Error {\\n  readonly code: number;     // ErrorCode value\\n  readonly data?: unknown;   // Optional additional info\\n}\\n\",\"title\":\"RpcError\",\"titles\":[\"Errors\"]},{\"href\":\"/glossary/errors#errorcode\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Constant</th><th>Value</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>NoSuchEntity</code></td><td>-32001</td><td>Account or entity not found (not funded)</td></tr><tr><td><code>AccountMigratedToEntity</code></td><td>-32002</td><td>1.x account migrated to 2.x entity format</td></tr><tr><td><code>NoSuchBlock</code></td><td>-32003</td><td>Block hash or height not found</td></tr><tr><td><code>NoSuchDeploy</code></td><td>-32004</td><td>Transaction or deploy hash not found</td></tr><tr><td><code>FailedToGetBalance</code></td><td>-32005</td><td>Balance query failed</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/glossary/errors.mdx#errorcode\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nConstantValueDescriptionNoSuchEntity-32001Account or entity not found (not funded)AccountMigratedToEntity-320021.x account migrated to 2.x entity formatNoSuchBlock-32003Block hash or height not foundNoSuchDeploy-32004Transaction or deploy hash not foundFailedToGetBalance-32005Balance query failed\\n\",\"title\":\"ErrorCode\",\"titles\":[\"Errors\"]},{\"href\":\"/glossary/errors#httperror\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Thrown for HTTP transport failures.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">class</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> HttpError</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> extends</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> Error</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> {</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  readonly</span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> statusCode</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> number</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">; </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// HTTP status (e.g., 503)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">}</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/glossary/errors.mdx#httperror\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nThrown for HTTP transport failures.\\nclass HttpError extends Error {\\n  readonly statusCode: number; // HTTP status (e.g., 503)\\n}\\n\",\"title\":\"HttpError\",\"titles\":[\"Errors\"]},{\"href\":\"/glossary/errors#sse-result-errors\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>The SSE client returns <code>Result&lt;boolean, string&gt;</code> from <code>ts-results</code>:</p>\\n<table><thead><tr><th>String</th><th>When</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>&#x27;Already subscribed to this event&#x27;</code></td><td><code>subscribe()</code> called twice for same event</td></tr><tr><td><code>&#x27;Not subscribed to this event&#x27;</code></td><td><code>unsubscribe()</code> called when not subscribed</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/glossary/errors.mdx#sse-result-errors\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nThe SSE client returns Result&lt;boolean, string&gt; from ts-results:\\nStringWhen&#x27;Already subscribed to this event&#x27;subscribe() called twice for same event&#x27;Not subscribed to this event&#x27;unsubscribe() called when not subscribed\\n\",\"title\":\"SSE Result Errors\",\"titles\":[\"Errors\"]},{\"href\":\"/glossary/errors#custom-errors\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>When thrown</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>ErrInvalidPublicKeyAlgo</code></td><td>Unknown key algorithm prefix byte</td></tr><tr><td><code>ErrInvalidBidAddrTag</code></td><td>Invalid BidAddr tag byte</td></tr></tbody></table>\",\"id\":\"pages/glossary/errors.mdx#custom-errors\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nClassWhen thrownErrInvalidPublicKeyAlgoUnknown key algorithm prefix byteErrInvalidBidAddrTagInvalid BidAddr tag byte\",\"title\":\"Custom Errors\",\"titles\":[\"Errors\"]}]}}"
