:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getErrorMessage</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">error</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Failed:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, message);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">}</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst submitResult = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n \\nconst tx = await rpcClient.waitForTransaction(\\n  submitResult.transactionHash,\\n  { timeout: 300_000 }\\n);\\n \\nif (tx.executionInfo?.executionResult.isSuccess()) {\\n  console.log(&#x27;Confirmed!&#x27;);\\n} else {\\n  const message = tx.executionInfo?.executionResult.getErrorMessage();\\n  console.error(&#x27;Failed:&#x27;, message);\\n}\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"waitForTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"waitForTransaction\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction#hash\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>string | Hash</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>The transaction hash to wait for.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction.mdx#hash\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nType: string | Hash\\n\\nThe transaction hash to wait for.\\n\",\"title\":\"hash\",\"titles\":[\"waitForTransaction\",\"Parameters\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/transactions/waitForTransaction#options-optional\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><stro