+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# queryBalanceByBlockHash\\n\\nReturns the CSPR balance at a specific block, identified by hash.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.queryBalanceByBlockHash(\\n  'abc123...',\\n  { mainPurseUnderPublicKey: publicKey.toHex() }\\n);\\n\\nconsole.log(result.balance.toString());\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### hash\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nBlock hash as hex string.\\n\\n### identifier\\n\\n- **Type:** `PurseIdentifier`\\n\\nWhich purse to query. Same options as [`queryLatestBalance`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance).\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<QueryBalanceResult>`\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`queryLatestBalance`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance)\\n- [`queryBalanceByBlockHeight`](/actions/balance/queryBalanceByBlockHeight)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/queryBalanceByBlockHash#querybalancebyblockhash\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the CSPR balance at a specific block, identified by hash.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/balance/queryBalanceByBlockHash.mdx#querybalancebyblockhash\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the CSPR balance at a specific block, identified by hash.\\n\",\"title\":\"queryBalanceByBlockHash\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/queryBalanceByBlockHash#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/balance/queryBalanceByBlockHash.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"queryBalanceByBlockHash\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/queryBalanceByBlockHash#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"backgro