+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getLatestBlockTransfers\\n\\nReturns the transfers included in the most recent block.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getLatestBlockTransfers();\\n\\nfor (const transfer of result.transfers) {\\n  const t = transfer.getTransferV2() ?? transfer.getTransferV1();\\n  console.log(t?.from, t?.to, t?.amount);\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<ChainGetBlockTransfersResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface ChainGetBlockTransfersResult {\\n  blockHash: Hash;\\n  transfers: Transfer[];\\n}\\n```\\n\\nEach `Transfer` wraps either a V1 or V2 transfer record. Use `.getTransferV2() ?? .getTransferV1()` for version-compatible access.\\n\\n## Transfer Fields\\n\\n| Field | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `from` | `AccountHash` | Sender account hash |\\n| `to` | `AccountHash \\\\| undefined` | Recipient account hash |\\n| `amount` | `BigNumber` | Transfer amount in motes |\\n| `deployHash` | `Hash` | Transaction/deploy that caused this transfer |\\n| `id` | `number \\\\| undefined` | Transfer memo ID |\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getBlockTransfersByHash`](/actions/block/getBlockTransfersByHash)\\n- [`getBlockTransfersByHeight`](/actions/block/getBlockTransfersByHeight)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getLatestBlockTransfers#getlatestblocktransfers\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the transfers included in the most recent block.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/block/getLatestBlockTransfers.mdx#getlatestblocktransfers\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the transfers included in the most recent block.\\n\",\"title\":\"getLatestBlockTransfers\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/block/getLatestBlockTransfers#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code