+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# PublicKey\\n\\nRepresents a cryptographic public key. Used for account identification, signature verification, and deriving account hashes.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { PublicKey, KeyAlgorithm } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// From hex string (with algorithm prefix byte)\\nconst publicKey = PublicKey.fromHex('01a8b1d7f4e9c2...');\\n\\n// Derive the account hash (on-chain identifier)\\nconst accountHash = publicKey.accountHash();\\nconsole.log(accountHash.toFormattedStr());\\n// → 'account-hash-abc123...'\\n```\\n\\n## Methods\\n\\n### PublicKey.fromHex\\n\\nParses a public key from a hex string with an algorithm prefix byte.\\n\\n```ts\\nPublicKey.fromHex(publicKeyHex: string, checksummed?: boolean): PublicKey\\n```\\n\\n#### Parameters\\n\\n##### publicKeyHex\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nHex-encoded public key. Prefix byte: `01` = ED25519, `02` = SECP256K1.\\n\\n##### checksummed\\n\\n- **Type:** `boolean` (optional, default `false`)\\n\\nWhether to validate EIP-55 checksum encoding.\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`PublicKey`\\n\\n#### Example\\n\\n```ts\\n// ED25519 public key (starts with '01')\\nconst ed25519Key = PublicKey.fromHex('01a8b1d7f4e9c2...');\\n\\n// SECP256K1 public key (starts with '02', 33 bytes compressed)\\nconst secp256k1Key = PublicKey.fromHex('0202f5a92ab6da536e7b1a351406f3744224bec85d7acbab1497b65de48a1a707b64');\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### PublicKey.fromPem\\n\\nImports a public key from PEM format.\\n\\n```ts\\nPublicKey.fromPem(content: string, algorithm: KeyAlgorithm): PublicKey\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### PublicKey.fromBytes\\n\\nCreates a public key from raw bytes. Returns a result wrapper, not a direct `PublicKey`.\\n\\n```ts\\nPublicKey.fromBytes(source: Uint8Array): IResultWithBytes<PublicKey>\\n```\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { IResultWithBytes } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\nconst result = PublicKey.fromBytes(bytes);\\nif (result.result.err) {\\n  console.error(result.result.val);\\n} else {\\n  const publicKey = result.result.val;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### toHex\\n\\nReturns the prefixed hex string representation.\\n\\n```ts\\npublicKey.toHex(checksummed?: boolean): string\\n```\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`string` - `'01' + 32-byte-hex` for ED25519 or `'02' + 33-byte-hex` for SECP256K1.\\n\\n#### Example\\n\\n```ts\\nconsole.log(publicKey.toHex());\\n// → '01a8b1d7f4e9c2...' (66 chars for ED25519)\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### accountHash\\n\\nDerives the on-chain account hash from this public key.\\n\\n```ts\\npublicKey.accountHash(): AccountHash\\n```\\n\\nThe account hash is computed as `blake2b-256(algorithmName + '\\\\0' + publicKeyBytes)`.\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`AccountHash`\\n\\n#### Example\\n\\n```ts\\nconst hash = publicKey.accountHash();\\nconsole.log(hash.toFormattedStr());\\n// → 'account-hash-abc123...'\\n\\n// Used as deposit address for exchanges\\nconst depositAddress = publicKey.accountHash().toFormattedStr();\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n### verifySignature\\n\\nVerifies a signature against a message.\\n\\n```ts\\npublicKey.verifySignature(message: Uint8Array, sig: Uint8Array): boolean\\n```\\n\\n#### Parameters\\n\\n##### message\\n\\n- **Type:** `Uint8Array`\\n\\nThe original message bytes.\\n\\n##### signature\\n\\n- **Type:** `Uint8Array`\\n\\nThe signature bytes to verify.\\n\\n#### Return Value\\n\\n`boolean`\\n\\n---\\n\\n### toPem / toBytes\\n\\n```ts\\npublicKey.toPem(): string\\npublicKey.toBytes(): Uint8Array  // without prefix byte\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Properties\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `algorithm` | `KeyAlgorithm` | `ED25519` or `SECP256K1` |\\n\\n## Key Format Reference\\n\\n| Algorithm | Prefix | Key bytes | toHex() length |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| ED25519 | `01` | 32 bytes | 66 chars |\\n| SECP256K1 | `02` | 33 bytes compressed | 68 chars |\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/accounts/public-key#publickey\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Represents a cryptographic public key. Used for account identification, signature verification, and deriving account hashes.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/accounts/public-key.mdx#publickey\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nRepresents a cryptographic public key. Used for account identification, signature verification, and deriving account hashes.\\n\",\"title\":\"PublicKey\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/accounts/public-key#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/accounts/public-key.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"PublicKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/accounts/public-key#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// From hex string (with algorithm prefix byte)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> publicKey</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> PublicKey.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">fromHex</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;01a8b1d7f4e9c2...&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Derive the account hash (on-chain identifier)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> accountHash</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> publicKey.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">accountHash</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(accountHash.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toFormattedStr</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">());</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// → &#x27;account-hash-abc123...&#x27;</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/accounts/public-key.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// From hex string (with algorithm prefix byte)\\nconst publicKey = PublicKey.fromHex(&#x27;01a8b1d7f4e9c2...&#x27;);\\n \\n// Derive the account hash (on-chain identifier)\\nconst accountHash = publicKey.accountHash();\\nconsole.log(accountHash.toFormattedStr());\\n// → &#x27;account-hash-abc123...&#x27;\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"PublicKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/accounts/public-key#methods\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/accounts/public-key.mdx#methods\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Methods\",\"titles\":[\"PublicKey\"]},{\"href\":\"/accounts/public-key#publickeyfromhex\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>Parses a public key from a hex string with an algorithm prefix byte.</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shik