+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# Transaction Builders\\n\\nTransaction builders provide a fluent API for constructing `TransactionV1` (Casper 2.x) transactions.\\n\\n## Available Builders\\n\\n| Builder | Use Case |\\n|---|---|\\n| [`NativeTransferBuilder`](/builders/NativeTransferBuilder) | Send CSPR to another account |\\n| [`NativeDelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder) | Stake CSPR with a validator |\\n| [`NativeUndelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder) | Unstake CSPR from a validator |\\n| [`NativeRedelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder) | Move stake to a different validator |\\n| [`ContractCallBuilder`](/builders/ContractCallBuilder) | Call a smart contract entry point |\\n| [`SessionBuilder`](/builders/SessionBuilder) | Deploy and run WASM session code |\\n\\n## General Pattern\\n\\nAll builders follow the same pattern:\\n\\n```ts\\nconst transaction = new SomeBuilder()\\n  .from(senderPublicKey)    // required: who is sending\\n  ./* ...chain options... */\\n  .chainName('casper')      // required: network name\\n  .payment(100_000_000)     // optional: gas payment in motes\\n  .ttl('30m')               // optional: time to live\\n  .timestamp(Date.now())    // optional: creation time\\n  .build();                 // returns Transaction\\n\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);  // sign before submitting\\n\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n```\\n\\n## Common Builder Options\\n\\n| Method | Type | Default | Description |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| `.from(key)` | `PublicKey` | required | Transaction initiator |\\n| `.chainName(name)` | `string` | required | `'casper'` or `'casper-test'` |\\n| `.payment(motes)` | `number` | varies | Gas payment in motes |\\n| `.ttl(duration)` | `string` | `'30m'` | Time-to-live (e.g. `'1h'`, `'2m'`) |\\n| `.timestamp(ms)` | `number` | `Date.now()` | Creation timestamp |\\n\\n## Signing\\n\\n```ts\\n// Single signer\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\n\\n// Multi-sig: add additional approvals\\ntransaction.sign(cosignerPrivateKey);\\n\\n// External signer (hardware wallet)\\nconst hashBytes = transaction.getTransactionV1()!.hash.toBytes();\\nconst signature = await hardwareWallet.sign(hashBytes);\\ntransaction.setSignature(signature, signerPublicKey);\\n```\\n\\n## Submitting\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\nconsole.log('Hash:', result.transactionHash);\\n```\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/builders/introduction#transaction-builders\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Transaction builders provide a fluent API for constructing <code>TransactionV1</code> (Casper 2.x) transactions.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/introduction.mdx#transaction-builders\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nTransaction builders provide a fluent API for constructing TransactionV1 (Casper 2.x) transactions.\\n\",\"title\":\"Transaction Builders\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/builders/introduction#available-builders\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Builder</th><th>Use Case</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeTransferBuilder\\\"><code>NativeTransferBuilder</code></a></td><td>Send CSPR to another account</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeDelegateBuilder</code></a></td><td>Stake CSPR with a validator</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeUndelegateBuilder</code></a></td><td>Unstake CSPR from a validator</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder\\\"><code>NativeRedelegateBuilder</code></a></td><td>Move stake to a different validator</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/builders/ContractCallBuilder\\\"><code>ContractCallBuilder</code></a></td><td>Call a smart contract entry point</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\\\"/builders/SessionBuilder\\\"><code>SessionBuilder</code></a></td><td>Deploy and run WASM session code</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/introduction.mdx#available-builders\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nBuilderUse CaseNativeTransferBuilderSend CSPR to another accountNativeDelegateBuilderStake CSPR with a validatorNativeUndelegateBuilderUnstake CSPR from a validatorNativeRedelegateBuilderMove stake to a different validatorContractCallBuilderCall a smart contract entry pointSessionBuilderDeploy and run WASM session code\\n\",\"title\":\"Available Builders\",\"titles\":[\"Transaction Builders\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/introduction#general-pattern\",\"html\":\"\\n<p>All builders follow the same pattern:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> transaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> SomeBuilder</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">from</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(senderPublicKey)    </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// required: who is sending</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">/* ...chain options... */</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">chainName</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;casper&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)      </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// required: network name</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">payment</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\">100_000_000</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)     </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// optional: gas payment in motes</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">ttl</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;30m&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">)               </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// optional: time to live</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">timestamp</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(Date.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">now</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">())    </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// optional: creation time</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  .</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">build</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();                 </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// returns Transaction</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);  </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// sign before submitting</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(transaction);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/introduction.mdx#general-pattern\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nAll builders follow the same pattern:\\nconst transaction = new SomeBuilder()\\n  .from(senderPublicKey)    // required: who is sending\\n  ./* ...chain options... */\\n  .chainName(&#x27;casper&#x27;)      // required: network name\\n  .payment(100_000_000)     // optional: gas payment in motes\\n  .ttl(&#x27;30m&#x27;)               // optional: time to live\\n  .timestamp(Date.now())    // optional: creation time\\n  .build();                 // returns Transaction\\n \\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);  // sign before submitting\\n \\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\n\",\"title\":\"General Pattern\",\"titles\":[\"Transaction Builders\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/introduction#common-builder-options\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>.from(key)</code></td><td><code>PublicKey</code></td><td>required</td><td>Transaction initiator</td></tr><tr><td><code>.chainName(name)</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>required</td><td><code>&#x27;casper&#x27;</code> or <code>&#x27;casper-test&#x27;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>.payment(motes)</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>varies</td><td>Gas payment in motes</td></tr><tr><td><code>.ttl(duration)</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>&#x27;30m&#x27;</code></td><td>Time-to-live (e.g. <code>&#x27;1h&#x27;</code>, <code>&#x27;2m&#x27;</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>.timestamp(ms)</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>Date.now()</code></td><td>Creation timestamp</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/introduction.mdx#common-builder-options\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nMethodTypeDefaultDescription.from(key)PublicKeyrequiredTransaction initiator.chainName(name)stringrequired&#x27;casper&#x27; or &#x27;casper-test&#x27;.payment(motes)numbervariesGas payment in motes.ttl(duration)string&#x27;30m&#x27;Time-to-live (e.g. &#x27;1h&#x27;, &#x27;2m&#x27;).timestamp(ms)numberDate.now()Creation timestamp\\n\",\"title\":\"Common Builder Options\",\"titles\":[\"Transaction Builders\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/introduction#signing\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Single signer</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(privateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// Multi-sig: add additional approvals</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(cosignerPrivateKey);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// External signer (hardware wallet)</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> hashBytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getTransactionV1</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">()</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">!</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">.hash.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toBytes</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">();</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> signature</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> hardwareWallet.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">sign</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(hashBytes);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">transaction.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">setSignature</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(signature, signerPublicKey);</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/introduction.mdx#signing\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// Single signer\\ntransaction.sign(privateKey);\\n \\n// Multi-sig: add additional approvals\\ntransaction.sign(cosignerPrivateKey);\\n \\n// External signer (hardware wallet)\\nconst hashBytes = transaction.getTransactionV1()!.hash.toBytes();\\nconst signature = await hardwareWallet.sign(hashBytes);\\ntransaction.setSignature(signature, signerPublicKey);\\n\",\"title\":\"Signing\",\"titles\":[\"Transaction Builders\"]},{\"href\":\"/builders/introduction#submitting\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">putTransaction</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(transaction);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(</span><span style=\\\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\\\">&#x27;Hash:&#x27;</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">, result.transactionHash);</span></span></code></pre>\",\"id\":\"pages/builders/introduction.mdx#submitting\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nconst result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);\\nconsole.log(&#x27;Hash:&#x27;, result.transactionHash);\",\"title\":\"Submitting\",\"titles\":[\"Transaction Builders\"]}]}}"
