+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# MinimalBlockInfo\\n\\nLightweight block summary containing only the most commonly needed fields.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { MinimalBlockInfo } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Class\\n\\n### `MinimalBlockInfo`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `creator` | `PublicKey` | Block creator's public key |\\n| `eraID` | `number` | Era this block belongs to |\\n| `hash` | `Hash` | Block hash |\\n| `height` | `number` | Block height |\\n| `stateRootHash` | `Hash` | State root hash |\\n| `timestamp` | `Timestamp` | Block creation timestamp |\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// MinimalBlockInfo typically appears in RPC responses like getEraSummary\\nconst { eraSummary } = await client.getEraSummaryLatest();\\n\\n// Block info is also embedded in various RPC responses\\nconst blockInfo: MinimalBlockInfo = /* from RPC response */;\\nconsole.log('Height:', blockInfo.height);\\nconsole.log('Hash:', blockInfo.hash.toHex());\\nconsole.log('Creator:', blockInfo.creator.toHex());\\n```\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`Block`](/types/block) - Full block with transactions and proofs\\n- [`EraSummary`](/types/era-summary) - Contains minimal block context\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/minimal-block-info#minimalblockinfo\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Lightweight block summary containing only the most commonly needed fields.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/minimal-block-info.mdx#minimalblockinfo\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nLightweight block summary containing only the most commonly needed fields.\\n\",\"title\":\"MinimalBlockInfo\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/minimal-block-info#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/minimal-block-info.mdx#import\",\"isPage\"