+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getLatestBalance\\n\\nReturns the balance of a purse by URef at the latest state. This is the legacy balance API for Casper 1.x.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getLatestBalance('uref-abc123...-007');\\nconsole.log(result.balanceValue);\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### purseURef\\n\\n- **Type:** `string`\\n\\nThe purse URef string in the format `uref-{hex}-{octal}`.\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<StateGetBalanceResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface StateGetBalanceResult {\\n  balanceValue: string; // balance in motes as a string\\n}\\n```\\n\\n:::note\\nFor Casper 2.x nodes, prefer [`queryLatestBalance`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance) which supports multiple identifier types.\\n:::\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`queryLatestBalance`](/actions/balance/queryLatestBalance)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/getLatestBalance#getlatestbalance\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the balance of a purse by URef at the latest state. This is the legacy balance API for Casper 1.x.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/balance/getLatestBalance.mdx#getlatestbalance\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the balance of a purse by URef at the latest state. This is the legacy balance API for Casper 1.x.\\n\",\"title\":\"getLatestBalance\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/getLatestBalance#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/balance/getLatestBalance.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestBalance\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/balance/getLatestBalance#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-them