+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# EraInfo\\n\\nContains seigniorage allocation information for an era - how rewards were distributed among validators and delegators.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { EraInfo, SeigniorageAllocation, ValidatorAllocation, DelegatorAllocation } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Classes\\n\\n### `EraInfo`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `seigniorageAllocations` | `SeigniorageAllocation[]` | All reward allocations for this era |\\n\\n#### Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew EraInfo(seigniorageAllocations?: SeigniorageAllocation[])\\n```\\n\\n### `SeigniorageAllocation`\\n\\nA discriminated union representing either a validator or delegator reward.\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `validator?` | `ValidatorAllocation` | Validator's reward allocation |\\n| `delegator?` | `DelegatorAllocation` | Delegator's reward allocation |\\n\\n#### Static Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nSeigniorageAllocation.fromJSON(json: any): SeigniorageAllocation\\n```\\n\\n### `ValidatorAllocation`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `validatorPublicKey` | `PublicKey` | Validator's public key |\\n| `amount` | `CLValueUInt512` | Reward amount in motes |\\n\\n### `DelegatorAllocation`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `delegatorKind` | `DelegationKind` | Delegator identification |\\n| `validatorPublicKey` | `PublicKey` | Validator being delegated to |\\n| `amount` | `CLValueUInt512` | Reward amount in motes |\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// EraInfo is stored in global state and returned via EraSummary\\nconst { eraSummary } = await client.getEraSummaryLatest();\\n\\nif (eraSummary.storedValue.eraInfo) {\\n  const eraInfo = eraSummary.storedValue.eraInfo;\\n\\n  for (const allocation of eraInfo.seigniorageAllocations) {\\n    if (allocation.validator) {\\n      console.log(\\n        'Validator reward:',\\n        allocation.validator.validatorPublicKey.toHex(),\\n        allocation.validator.amount.toString()\\n      );\\n    } else if (allocation.delegator) {\\n      console.log(\\n        'Delegator reward:',\\n        allocation.delegator.amount.toString()\\n      );\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`EraSummary`](/types/era-summary) - Contains `StoredValue` with `EraInfo`\\n- [`getEraSummaryLatest`](/actions/auction/getEraSummaryLatest) - RPC action\\n- [`EraEnd`](/types/era-end) - Era-end data on switch blocks\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/era-info#erainfo\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Contains seigniorage allocation information for an era - how rewards were distributed among validators and delegators.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/era-info.mdx#erainfo\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nContains seigniorage allocation information for an era - how rewards were distributed among validators and delegators.\\n\",\"title\":\"EraInfo\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/era-info#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/era-info.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"EraInfo\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/era-info#classes\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/era-info.mdx#classes\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Classes\",\"titles\":[\"EraInfo\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/era-info#erainfo-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>seigniorageAllocations</code></td><td><code>SeigniorageAllocation[]</code></td><td>All reward allocations for this era</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/era-info.mdx#erainfo-1\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nPropertyTypeDescriptionseigniorageAllocationsSeigniorageAllocation[]All reward allocations f