+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getLatestAuctionInfo\\n\\nReturns the current auction state including all validator bids and delegations.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getLatestAuctionInfo();\\n\\nconst bids = result.auctionState.getBids();\\nfor (const bid of bids) {\\n  console.log('Validator:', bid.publicKey.toHex());\\n  console.log('Stake:', bid.bid.stakedAmount);\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<StateGetAuctionInfoResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface StateGetAuctionInfoResult {\\n  auctionState: AuctionState;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## AuctionState Methods\\n\\n| Method | Return Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `getBids()` | `ValidatorBid[]` | All validator bids |\\n| `getEraValidators()` | `EraValidators[]` | Validators per era |\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getEraSummaryLatest`](/actions/auction/getEraSummaryLatest)\\n- [`getLatestValidatorReward`](/actions/auction/getLatestValidatorReward)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestAuctionInfo#getlatestauctioninfo\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the current auction state including all validator bids and delegations.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestAuctionInfo.mdx#getlatestauctioninfo\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the current auction state including all validator bids and delegations.\\n\",\"title\":\"getLatestAuctionInfo\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/auction/getLatestAuctionInfo#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/auction/getLatestAuctionInfo.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestAuctionInfo\"]},{\"href\":\"/act