+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# getLatestEntity\\n\\nReturns the addressable entity for an account or contract (Casper 2.x format).\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { RpcClient, HttpHandler } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\n// By public key\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getLatestEntity({\\n  publicKey: publicKey.toHex(),\\n});\\n\\nconsole.log(result.entity.entityAddr);\\nconsole.log(result.entity.mainPurse); // URef of main purse\\n```\\n\\n## Parameters\\n\\n### identifier\\n\\n- **Type:** `EntityIdentifier`\\n\\n```ts\\ntype EntityIdentifier =\\n  | { publicKey: string }      // public key hex\\n  | { accountHash: string }    // 'account-hash-abc...'\\n  | { entityAddr: string }     // 'entity-account-abc...'\\n```\\n\\n## Return Value\\n\\n`Promise<StateGetEntityResult>`\\n\\n```ts\\ninterface StateGetEntityResult {\\n  entity: AddressableEntity;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n:::note\\nThis method is for Casper 2.0 nodes. For 1.x compatibility, see [`getAccountInfo`](/actions/account/getAccountInfo).\\n:::\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n- [`getAccountInfo`](/actions/account/getAccountInfo)\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/actions/account/getLatestEntity#getlatestentity\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Returns the addressable entity for an account or contract (Casper 2.x format).</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/account/getLatestEntity.mdx#getlatestentity\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nReturns the addressable entity for an account or contract (Casper 2.x format).\\n\",\"title\":\"getLatestEntity\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/actions/account/getLatestEntity#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/account/getLatestEntity.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestEntity\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/account/getLatestEntity#usage\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// By public key</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">const</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> result</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> await</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> rpcClient.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">getLatestEntity</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">({</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">  publicKey: publicKey.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">toHex</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(),</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">});</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(result.entity.entityAddr);</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">console.</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\">log</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(result.entity.mainPurse); </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// URef of main purse</span></span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/account/getLatestEntity.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n// By public key\\nconst result = await rpcClient.getLatestEntity({\\n  publicKey: publicKey.toHex(),\\n});\\n \\nconsole.log(result.entity.entityAddr);\\nconsole.log(result.entity.mainPurse); // URef of main purse\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestEntity\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/account/getLatestEntity#parameters\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/actions/account/getLatestEntity.mdx#parameters\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Parameters\",\"titles\":[\"getLatestEntity\"]},{\"href\":\"/actions/account/getLatestEntity#identifier\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Type:</strong> <code>EntityIdentifier</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">type</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\"> EntityIdentifier</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  |</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> { </span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">publicKey</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> string</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> }      </span><span style=\\\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\\\">// public key hex</span></span>\\n<span class=\\\"line\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">  |</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\"> { </span><span style=\\\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\\\">accountHash</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> string</sp