+"{\"value\":{\"mdx\":\"# TransactionEntryPoint\\n\\nSpecifies which entry point a transaction targets - built-in system entry points or a custom contract entry point.\\n\\n## Import\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { TransactionEntryPoint, TransactionEntryPointEnum } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n```\\n\\n## Enum\\n\\n### `TransactionEntryPointEnum`\\n\\n| Value | Description |\\n|---|---|\\n| `Custom` | A custom contract entry point |\\n| `Transfer` | Native token transfer |\\n| `AddBid` | Add a validator bid |\\n| `WithdrawBid` | Withdraw a validator bid |\\n| `Delegate` | Delegate stake to a validator |\\n| `Undelegate` | Remove delegation |\\n| `Redelegate` | Move delegation to another validator |\\n| `ActivateBid` | Reactivate an inactive bid |\\n| `ChangeBidPublicKey` | Change a validator's public key |\\n| `Call` | Generic contract call |\\n| `AddReservations` | Add delegation reservations |\\n| `CancelReservations` | Cancel delegation reservations |\\n\\n## Class\\n\\n### `TransactionEntryPoint`\\n\\n| Property | Type | Description |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| `type` | `TransactionEntryPointEnum` | Entry point type |\\n| `customEntryPoint?` | `string` | Entry point name for `Custom` type |\\n\\n#### Constructor\\n\\n```ts\\nnew TransactionEntryPoint(\\n  type: TransactionEntryPointEnum,\\n  customEntryPoint?: string\\n)\\n```\\n\\n#### Methods\\n\\n```ts\\nep.tag(): number          // Numeric tag (0–11)\\nep.toBytes(): Uint8Array\\nep.toJSON(): unknown\\nTransactionEntryPoint.fromJSON(json: any): TransactionEntryPoint\\nTransactionEntryPoint.fromBytes(bytes: Uint8Array): TransactionEntryPoint\\n```\\n\\n## Usage\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { TransactionEntryPoint, TransactionEntryPointEnum } from 'casper-js-sdk';\\n\\n// Native transfer\\nconst transfer = new TransactionEntryPoint(TransactionEntryPointEnum.Transfer);\\n\\n// Custom contract entry point\\nconst custom = new TransactionEntryPoint(\\n  TransactionEntryPointEnum.Custom,\\n  'mint'\\n);\\n\\n// Delegate\\nconst delegate = new TransactionEntryPoint(TransactionEntryPointEnum.Delegate);\\n```\\n\\n:::tip\\nTransaction builders like `NativeTransferBuilder` and `NativeDelegateBuilder` set the entry point automatically.\\n:::\\n\\n## See Also\\n\\n- [`TransactionV1Payload`](/types/transaction-v1-payload) - Contains `entryPoint`\\n- [Transaction Builders](/builders/introduction) - Set entry points automatically\\n\",\"document\":[{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-entry-point#transactionentrypoint\",\"html\":\"</header>\\n<p>Specifies which entry point a transaction targets - built-in system entry points or a custom contract entry point.</p>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-entry-point.mdx#transactionentrypoint\",\"isPage\":true,\"text\":\"\\nSpecifies which entry point a transaction targets - built-in system entry points or a custom contract entry point.\\n\",\"title\":\"TransactionEntryPoint\",\"titles\":[]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-entry-point#import\",\"html\":\"\\n<pre class=\\\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark-dimmed\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#22272e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#adbac7\\\" tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code><span class=\\\"line\\\" data-empty-line=\\\"true\\\"> </span></code></pre>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-entry-point.mdx#import\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n\",\"title\":\"Import\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionEntryPoint\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-entry-point#enum\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-entry-point.mdx#enum\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Enum\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionEntryPoint\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-entry-point#transactionentrypointenum\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Value</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>Custom</code></td><td>A custom contract entry point</td></tr><tr><td><code>Transfer</code></td><td>Native token transfer</td></tr><tr><td><code>AddBid</code></td><td>Add a validator bid</td></tr><tr><td><code>WithdrawBid</code></td><td>Withdraw a validator bid</td></tr><tr><td><code>Delegate</code></td><td>Delegate stake to a validator</td></tr><tr><td><code>Undelegate</code></td><td>Remove delegation</td></tr><tr><td><code>Redelegate</code></td><td>Move delegation to another validator</td></tr><tr><td><code>ActivateBid</code></td><td>Reactivate an inactive bid</td></tr><tr><td><code>ChangeBidPublicKey</code></td><td>Change a validator&#x27;s public key</td></tr><tr><td><code>Call</code></td><td>Generic contract call</td></tr><tr><td><code>AddReservations</code></td><td>Add delegation reservations</td></tr><tr><td><code>CancelReservations</code></td><td>Cancel delegation reservations</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-entry-point.mdx#transactionentrypointenum\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\nValueDescriptionCustomA custom contract entry pointTransferNative token transferAddBidAdd a validator bidWithdrawBidWithdraw a validator bidDelegateDelegate stake to a validatorUndelegateRemove delegationRedelegateMove delegation to another validatorActivateBidReactivate an inactive bidChangeBidPublicKeyChange a validator&#x27;s public keyCallGeneric contract callAddReservationsAdd delegation reservationsCancelReservationsCancel delegation reservations\\n\",\"title\":\"TransactionEntryPointEnum\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionEntryPoint\",\"Enum\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-entry-point#class\",\"html\":\"\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-entry-point.mdx#class\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\",\"title\":\"Class\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionEntryPoint\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-entry-point#transactionentrypoint-1\",\"html\":\"\\n<table><thead><tr><th>Property</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>type</code></td><td><code>TransactionEntryPointEnum</code></td><td>Entry point type</td></tr><tr><td><code>customEntryPoint?</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Entry point name for <code>Custom</code> type</td></tr></tbody></t