;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\\\"> delegate</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> =</span><span style=\\\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\\\"> new</span><span style=\\\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\\\"> TransactionEntryPoint</span><span style=\\\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\\\">(TransactionEntryPointEnum.Delegate);</span></span></code></pre>\\n<aside data-callout=\\\"tip\\\"><p>Transaction builders like <code>NativeTransferBuilder</code> and <code>NativeDelegateBuilder</code> set the entry point automatically.</p></aside>\\n\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-entry-point.mdx#usage\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n \\n \\n// Native transfer\\nconst transfer = new TransactionEntryPoint(TransactionEntryPointEnum.Transfer);\\n \\n// Custom contract entry point\\nconst custom = new TransactionEntryPoint(\\n  TransactionEntryPointEnum.Custom,\\n  &#x27;mint&#x27;\\n);\\n \\n// Delegate\\nconst delegate = new TransactionEntryPoint(TransactionEntryPointEnum.Delegate);\\nTransaction builders like NativeTransferBuilder and NativeDelegateBuilder set the entry point automatically.\\n\",\"title\":\"Usage\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionEntryPoint\"]},{\"href\":\"/types/transaction-entry-point#see-also\",\"html\":\"\\n<ul>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/types/transaction-v1-payload\\\"><code>TransactionV1Payload</code></a> - Contains <code>entryPoint</code></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/builders/introduction\\\">Transaction Builders</a> - Set entry points automatically</li>\\n</ul>\",\"id\":\"pages/types/transaction-entry-point.mdx#see-also\",\"isPage\":false,\"text\":\"\\n\\nTransactionV1Payload - Contains entryPoint\\nTransaction Builders - Set entry points automatically\\n\",\"title\":\"See Also\",\"titles\":[\"TransactionEntryPoint\"]}]}}"
