+#### `Unbond`
+
+A pending unbonding request.
+
+| Property             | Type          | Description                    |
+| -------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------ |
+| `validatorPublicKey` | `PublicKey`   | Validator being unbonded from  |
+| `eras`               | `UnbondEra[]` | Eras in which unbonding occurs |
