+#### `TransformKey`
+
+Used in V1 execution results - a key + transform kind pair.
+
+| Property    | Type            | Description      |
+| ----------- | --------------- | ---------------- |
+| `key`       | `Key`           | Global state key |
+| `transform` | `TransformKind` | Transformation   |
+
+#### `NamedKeyKind`
+
+Returned when parsing a `WriteNamedKey` transform.
+
+| Property   | Type   | Description     |
+| ---------- | ------ | --------------- |
