+## NativeUndelegateBuilder
+
+Builds a native undelegate transaction to unstake CSPR from a validator.
+
+### Import
+
+```ts
+import { NativeUndelegateBuilder, PublicKey } from 'casper-js-sdk';
+```
+
+### Usage
+
+```ts
+const transaction = new NativeUndelegateBuilder()
+  .from(delegatorPublicKey)
+  .validator(validatorPublicKey)
+  .amount('500000000000')  // 500 CSPR to unstake
+  .chainName('casper')
+  .payment(2_500_000_000)
+  .build();
+
+transaction.sign(privateKey);
+const result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);
+```
+
+### Methods
+
+#### .from(publicKey)
+
+* **Type:** `PublicKey` - required
+
+#### .validator(publicKey)
+
+* **Type:** `PublicKey` - required
+
+The validator to unstake from.
+
+#### .amount(motes)
+
+* **Type:** `BigNumber | string` - required
+
+Amount to unstake in motes.
+
+#### .chainName(name)
+
+* **Type:** `string` - required
+
+### Notes
+
+* After undelegating, there is an **unbonding period** of 7 eras (\~14 hours) before funds are returned.
+* During the unbonding period, the stake does not earn rewards.
+
+### Related
+
+* [`NativeDelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder)
+* [`NativeRedelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder)
+
+
+## SessionBuilder
+
+Builds a transaction that deploys and executes WASM session code. Used for contract deployment and complex one-off operations.
+
+### Import
+
+```ts
+import { SessionBuilder, Args, CLValue, PublicKey } from 'casper-js-sdk';
+```
+
+### Usage
+
+```ts
+import * as fs from 'fs';
+
+const wasmBytes = fs.readFileSync('contract.wasm');
+
+const args = Args.fromMap({
+  token_name: CLValue.newCLString('MyToken'),
+  token_symbol: CLValue.newCLString('MTK'),
+  total_supply: CLValue.newCLUInt256('1000000000'),
+});
+
+const transaction = new SessionBuilder()
+  .from(deployerPublicKey)
+  .wasm(wasmBytes)
+  .runtimeArgs(args)
+  .chainName('casper')
+  .payment(200_000_000_000)  // WASM deploys require more gas
+  .build();
+
+transaction.sign(privateKey);
+const result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);
+```
+
+### Methods
+
+#### .from(publicKey)
+
+* **Type:** `PublicKey` - required
+
+#### .wasm(bytes)
+
+* **Type:** `Uint8Array` - required
+
+The compiled WASM bytecode to execute.
+
+#### .runtimeArgs(args)
+
+* **Type:** `Args` - optional
+
+Arguments passed to the WASM's `call` function.
+
+#### .chainName(name)
+
+* **Type:** `string` - required
+
+#### .payment(motes)
+
+* **Type:** `number` - optional
+
+WASM execution typically requires much higher gas than native transfers (50–500 CSPR depending on contract size and complexity).
+
+### Return Value
+
+`Transaction`
+
+### Notes
+
+* Session code runs in the context of the caller's account.
+* Use `ContractCallBuilder` for calling already-deployed contracts.
+* Gas costs scale with WASM size and execution complexity.
+
+### Related
+
+* [`ContractCallBuilder`](/builders/ContractCallBuilder)
+
+
+## Transaction Builders
+
+Transaction builders provide a fluent API for constructing `TransactionV1` (Casper 2.x) transactions.
+
+### Available Builders
+
+| Builder                                                        | Use Case                            |
+| -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
+| [`NativeTransferBuilder`](/builders/NativeTransferBuilder)     | Send CSPR to another account        |
+| [`NativeDelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeDelegateBuilder)     | Stake CSPR with a validator         |
+| [`NativeUndelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeUndelegateBuilder) | Unstake CSPR from a validator       |
+| [`NativeRedelegateBuilder`](/builders/NativeRedelegateBuilder) | Move stake to a different validator |
+| [`ContractCallBuilder`](/builders/ContractCallBuilder)         | Call a smart contract entry point   |
+| [`SessionBuilder`](/builders/SessionBuilder)                   | Deploy and run WASM session code    |
+
+### General Pattern
+
+All builders follow the same pattern:
+
+```ts
+const transaction = new SomeBuilder()
+  .from(senderPublicKey)    // required: who is sending
+  ./* ...chain options... */
+  .chainName('casper')      // required: network name
+  .payment(100_000_000)     // optional: gas payment in motes
+  .ttl('30m')               // optional: time to live
+  .timestamp(Date.now())    // optional: creation time
+  .build();                 // returns Transaction
+
+transaction.sign(privateKey);  // sign before submitting
+
+const result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);
+```
+
+### Common Builder Options
+
+| Method             | Type        | Default      | Description                        |
+| ------------------ | ----------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |
+| `.from(key)`       | `PublicKey` | required     | Transaction initiator              |
+| `.chainName(name)` | `string`    | required     | `'casper'` or `'casper-test'`      |
+| `.payment(motes)`  | `number`    | varies       | Gas payment in motes               |
+| `.ttl(duration)`   | `string`    | `'30m'`      | Time-to-live (e.g. `'1h'`, `'2m'`) |
+| `.timestamp(ms)`   | `number`    | `Date.now()` | Creation timestamp                 |
+
+### Signing
+
+```ts
+// Single signer
+transaction.sign(privateKey);
+
+// Multi-sig: add additional approvals
+transaction.sign(cosignerPrivateKey);
+
+// External signer (hardware wallet)
+const hashBytes = transaction.getTransactionV1()!.hash.toBytes();
+const signature = await hardwareWallet.sign(hashBytes);
+transaction.setSignature(signature, signerPublicKey);
+```
+
+### Submitting
+
+```ts
+const result = await rpcClient.putTransaction(transaction);
+console.log('Hash:', result.transactionHash);
+```
+
